WEBVTT

1
00:02:11.882 --> 00:02:13.425
Doctor...

2
00:02:14.092 --> 00:02:17.721
The internet has confused
me with too many options

3
00:02:18.096 --> 00:02:19.222
That's why I'm here.

4
00:02:19.473 --> 00:02:21.016
I need some help.

5
00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:23.393
I..-

6
00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:27.230
I want to kill myself.

7
00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:29.775
Suicide.

8
00:02:33.236 --> 00:02:35.197
I haven't showered in a week...

9
00:02:35.781 --> 00:02:37.699
nor have I
spoken to anyone.

10
00:02:38.075 --> 00:02:41.244
Even my ceiling fan
stopped responding.

11
00:02:42.579 --> 00:02:45.290
Maybe I'm going insane.

12
00:02:45.582 --> 00:02:47.542
Slightly, but...

13
00:02:56.593 --> 00:02:58.595
The homes and hearts of you...

14
00:02:58.887 --> 00:03:00.889
South Indians
are the same...

15
00:03:01.139 --> 00:03:02.766
completely hollow.

16
00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:15.028
How can I forget...

17
00:03:16.446 --> 00:03:20.533
I've replayed that day
in my mind a thousand times.

18
00:03:20.534 --> 00:03:21.701
And what is this
supposed to be?

19
00:03:21.702 --> 00:03:22.702
Sambar.

20
00:03:22.703 --> 00:03:24.329
- This?!
- Yes.

21
00:03:24.579 --> 00:03:26.248
Is there a problem?

22
00:03:26.623 --> 00:03:29.291
Just one problem.
You!

23
00:03:29.292 --> 00:03:31.252
If you have a problem,
keep moving.

24
00:03:31.253 --> 00:03:33.379
Excuse me!
You're cutting the line.

25
00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:35.381
How will he eat if
he doesn't cut the line?!

26
00:03:35.382 --> 00:03:37.049
I've been the 'Head Cook'
here for 10 years!

27
00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:39.970
Not a single 'complan'
against my sambar!

28
00:03:40.262 --> 00:03:42.847
There hasn't been a single 'complan',
that's why no improvement!

29
00:03:42.848 --> 00:03:44.474
Can anyone eat this?!

30
00:03:45.267 --> 00:03:46.226
No...

31
00:03:48.729 --> 00:03:51.106
But you'll get used
to it in a while.

32
00:03:51.398 --> 00:03:53.775
The rasgulla's not bad.
Try it.

33
00:03:55.485 --> 00:03:56.652
Give me the rasgulla.

34
00:03:56.653 --> 00:03:57.903
Finish your food first.

35
00:03:57.904 --> 00:03:59.948
Who do you think you are?

36
00:04:00.282 --> 00:04:01.283
Give it to me!

37
00:04:04.286 --> 00:04:05.412
One more.

38
00:04:05.746 --> 00:04:07.205
One rasgulla per student.

39
00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:09.123
Very good.

40
00:04:09.124 --> 00:04:11.167
What's edible,
one per student...

41
00:04:11.168 --> 00:04:12.877
miserable sambar unlimited!

42
00:04:12.878 --> 00:04:14.171
Give her mine...

43
00:04:15.672 --> 00:04:16.715
Please.

44
00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:19.009
Please.

45
00:04:30.395 --> 00:04:33.023
Where did this stupid
idiot come from?

46
00:04:33.231 --> 00:04:34.775
Teaching ME about sambar.

47
00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:38.028
Hi...

48
00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:40.447
I'm Krish.

49
00:04:46.328 --> 00:04:47.579
Ananya.

50
00:04:50.332 --> 00:04:52.417
Are you eating the mess
food for the first time?

51
00:04:52.751 --> 00:04:54.002
Yes.

52
00:04:54.503 --> 00:04:56.463
And this sambar is awful.

53
00:04:59.341 --> 00:05:01.218
I'm very hlmQW-

54
00:05:02.093 --> 00:05:03.720
Let's go out and eat.

55
00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.346
Class is in an hour!

56
00:05:05.347 --> 00:05:06.097
SQ?

57
00:05:15.398 --> 00:05:18.651
Half a tandoori chicken,
one roomali roti...

58
00:05:18.652 --> 00:05:20.319
Aren't you a South Indian?

59
00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.404
Tamilian.

60
00:05:21.947 --> 00:05:22.738
And...

61
00:05:22.739 --> 00:05:24.241
Do you have beer?

62
00:05:25.742 --> 00:05:27.369
Gujarat is a dry state.

63
00:05:27.536 --> 00:05:28.661
Why?

64
00:05:28.662 --> 00:05:30.371
<i>Gandhi“ was born here.</i>

65
00:05:30.372 --> 00:05:31.288
And...

66
00:05:31.289 --> 00:05:33.041
he was against beer?

67
00:05:36.336 --> 00:05:38.255
So... coming back
to my question.

68
00:05:39.297 --> 00:05:42.676
What's the difference between
South Indians and Tamilians?

69
00:05:42.843 --> 00:05:43.759
Huge difference.

70
00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:44.552
Thank you.

71
00:05:44.553 --> 00:05:47.931
For example, Tamil Brahmins
don't eat non-vegetarian...

72
00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:50.433
I'm from a pure,
Brahmin household.

73
00:05:51.518 --> 00:05:52.894
I can see that.

74
00:05:54.479 --> 00:05:55.521
And you?

75
00:05:55.522 --> 00:05:57.147
I'm a Punjabi.

76
00:05:57.148 --> 00:06:00.485
We can't digest our
chicken without alcohol.

77
00:06:04.322 --> 00:06:06.616
I hope you're not from llT.

78
00:06:08.618 --> 00:06:09.910
LIT Delhi.

79
00:06:09.911 --> 00:06:11.162
Why?

80
00:06:12.539 --> 00:06:13.665
Nothing!

81
00:06:13.832 --> 00:06:16.084
Why...
Is that a problem?

82
00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:18.003
Not yet...

83
00:06:18.253 --> 00:06:19.754
Excuse me?

84
00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:25.302
Don't you think llT
boys are a little weird?

85
00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:26.887
Meaning?

86
00:06:27.345 --> 00:06:28.387
I mean...

87
00:06:28.388 --> 00:06:31.432
In one week, I've received
10 proposals from llTians...

88
00:06:31.433 --> 00:06:32.683
for marriage!

89
00:06:32.684 --> 00:06:35.645
One even brought me
his grandmother's bangle!

90
00:06:36.021 --> 00:06:40.858
And you think today
will be your 11th?

91
00:06:40.859 --> 00:06:41.901
No...

92
00:06:41.902 --> 00:06:44.529
- That's not what I meant!
- Then what did you mean?

93
00:06:46.448 --> 00:06:47.239
Forget it.

94
00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.242
Just because a few boys hit
on you, you've lost your head?

95
00:06:50.619 --> 00:06:52.369
No, nothing like that.

96
00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.871
I'm sitting here, aren't I?

97
00:06:53.872 --> 00:06:55.832
Oh... wow! Thanks!

98
00:06:57.417 --> 00:06:58.752
I'm leaving.

99
00:06:59.085 --> 00:07:00.294
Here's my share...
Bye.

100
00:07:00.295 --> 00:07:02.005
I'm sorry! Sorry!

101
00:07:11.097 --> 00:07:12.349
Look...

102
00:07:12.641 --> 00:07:15.268
I don't have any
friends here...

103
00:07:16.102 --> 00:07:18.312
You're the only
one who seemed safe.

104
00:07:18.313 --> 00:07:19.355
For once...

105
00:07:19.356 --> 00:07:21.942
someone wasn't
hitting on me!

106
00:07:22.776 --> 00:07:23.944
You know what I mean, right?

107
00:07:24.486 --> 00:07:25.403
Wrong.

108
00:07:26.655 --> 00:07:27.614
I mean...

109
00:07:28.073 --> 00:07:29.741
Why wouldn't I hit on her?

110
00:07:30.116 --> 00:07:33.787
I'm a young,
red-blooded Punjabi.

111
00:07:35.372 --> 00:07:37.414
So what if I'm
average-looking?

112
00:07:37.415 --> 00:07:38.959
I was a man, after all.

113
00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.294
I mean... I am.

114
00:07:42.504 --> 00:07:44.005
Rs. 120 each.

115
00:07:46.049 --> 00:07:47.509
So... we're good, right?

116
00:08:09.614 --> 00:08:10.948
Settle down, everyone...

117
00:08:10.949 --> 00:08:12.283
Settle down!

118
00:08:12.867 --> 00:08:15.245
How many Economics
graduates here?

119
00:08:16.329 --> 00:08:18.122
Yes... Ms. Swaminathan.

120
00:08:18.123 --> 00:08:19.582
Do you recognize the curve?

121
00:08:20.125 --> 00:08:22.334
The basic marginal
utility curve, sir.

122
00:08:22.335 --> 00:08:25.964
Yes! And how do you represent
that curve mathematically?

123
00:08:28.133 --> 00:08:29.050
Um...

124
00:08:29.718 --> 00:08:32.929
Sir, the curve shows
different bundles of goods...

125
00:08:33.138 --> 00:08:36.266
Tell me the
mathematical formula.

126
00:08:38.018 --> 00:08:39.561
I don't know, sir.

127
00:08:41.062 --> 00:08:42.647
Notice, class...

128
00:08:43.189 --> 00:08:46.025
This is the state of Economics
education in this country.

129
00:08:46.026 --> 00:08:50.321
A top graduate doesn't
know the mathematical formula.

130
00:08:51.781 --> 00:08:52.907
You.

131
00:08:53.241 --> 00:08:55.367
The basic marginal utility of
a particular consumer...

132
00:08:55.368 --> 00:08:56.577
can be mathematically...

133
00:08:56.578 --> 00:08:58.621
explained as MU= DU/DQ,

134
00:08:58.872 --> 00:09:03.376
where DU represents change in utility
and DQ represents change in quantity...

135
00:09:07.255 --> 00:09:08.506
Ananya!

136
00:09:09.507 --> 00:09:10.884
Forget it!

137
00:09:11.092 --> 00:09:12.551
These things happen.

138
00:09:12.552 --> 00:09:14.053
Do you want to see
how many medals I have?

139
00:09:14.054 --> 00:09:16.890
I stood third
in my university!

140
00:09:19.184 --> 00:09:21.226
But now this Chatterjee
is going to fail me!

141
00:09:21.227 --> 00:09:24.438
I'm sure all the professors will
be laughing at me in the staffroom!

142
00:09:24.439 --> 00:09:25.398
Relax.

143
00:09:25.565 --> 00:09:27.816
In a couple of years you'll
be earning four times their salary.

144
00:09:27.817 --> 00:09:30.986
And they'll be giving the same
lecture to the next batch!

145
00:09:30.987 --> 00:09:32.780
Then you can smile.

146
00:09:32.781 --> 00:09:33.907
Okay?

147
00:09:34.199 --> 00:09:36.659
I've never been so insulted!

148
00:09:36.868 --> 00:09:39.370
Then don't raise
your hand in class.

149
00:09:43.166 --> 00:09:46.335
If you want...
I can help you with economics.

150
00:09:46.336 --> 00:09:49.506
I'm just asking;
this isn't the 11th proposal.

151
00:09:51.341 --> 00:09:53.718
I was a topper in Eco...

152
00:09:54.219 --> 00:09:55.803
Sorry but you're an engineer.

153
00:09:55.804 --> 00:09:57.137
How can you help me?

154
00:09:57.138 --> 00:09:57.889
Correct.

155
00:09:58.389 --> 00:09:59.099
Bye.

156
00:09:59.349 --> 00:10:00.517
Krish!

157
00:10:01.768 --> 00:10:05.021
Okay, done.
<i>8</i> 0' clock? My room.

158
00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:08.608
And by the way...
the score is now 22.

159
00:10:33.466 --> 00:10:35.593
Wow, you're taking
this really seriously!

160
00:10:36.594 --> 00:10:37.303
Come.

161
00:10:57.782 --> 00:10:58.615
My mother.

162
00:10:58.616 --> 00:10:59.701
She's a singer!

163
00:11:00.285 --> 00:11:02.327
Tried to get me to sing,
too...

164
00:11:02.328 --> 00:11:03.746
That's why I ran
away and came here!

165
00:11:04.539 --> 00:11:05.999
What's your story?

166
00:11:06.708 --> 00:11:08.125
I don't have a story.

167
00:11:08.126 --> 00:11:09.586
Are you an orphan?

168
00:11:10.128 --> 00:11:11.045
No...

169
00:11:11.212 --> 00:11:13.631
Well then,
what does your dad do?

170
00:11:14.716 --> 00:11:15.884
Shall we start?

171
00:11:17.218 --> 00:11:19.846
If you don't want to tell me,
just say so.

172
00:11:32.775 --> 00:11:33.735
Dad...

173
00:11:35.028 --> 00:11:36.403
Retired Army Officer.

174
00:11:36.404 --> 00:11:37.155
And?

175
00:11:37.739 --> 00:11:39.115
Do you want to fail?

176
00:11:40.241 --> 00:11:42.160
Why are you so grumpy?

177
00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:52.045
Here.

178
00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.671
What does he
have that I don't?

179
00:11:54.672 --> 00:11:57.091
Luck, bro. Luck!

180
00:12:03.556 --> 00:12:05.475
2 minutes...
Need to make a call.

181
00:12:16.319 --> 00:12:17.654
Kavita, phone!

182
00:12:20.156 --> 00:12:20.990
Kavi-

183
00:12:28.831 --> 00:12:29.499
Hello?

184
00:12:31.542 --> 00:12:32.335
Hello?

185
00:12:36.547 --> 00:12:37.215
Hello?!

186
00:12:59.153 --> 00:13:00.112
Hello?

187
00:13:00.113 --> 00:13:00.946
Mom!

188
00:13:00.947 --> 00:13:04.491
How many times have I told you?
Stay by the phone after 10!

189
00:13:04.492 --> 00:13:06.201
It's 11! And anyway...

190
00:13:06.202 --> 00:13:10.957
Shipra told me cell phone
vibrations cause heart attacks!

191
00:13:11.249 --> 00:13:14.751
How hard is it
to say hello to him?

192
00:13:14.752 --> 00:13:16.087
You're too stubborn.

193
00:13:16.296 --> 00:13:17.547
So are you.

194
00:13:17.755 --> 00:13:19.215
Forget it.

195
00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:20.717
How are you?

196
00:13:21.801 --> 00:13:22.592
I'm fine...

197
00:13:22.593 --> 00:13:25.178
Have they started serving
chicken there?!

198
00:13:25.179 --> 00:13:29.309
No! When we want non-veg,
we go out and eat.

199
00:13:29.767 --> 00:13:31.768
I still don't understand...

200
00:13:31.769 --> 00:13:35.398
Why did you leave
home and become vegetarian?!

201
00:13:36.065 --> 00:13:39.277
Listen! Have you
made any friends there?

202
00:13:40.028 --> 00:13:40.902
Yes!

203
00:13:40.903 --> 00:13:41.946
Uh...

204
00:13:42.405 --> 00:13:43.572
Punjabi?!

205
00:13:43.573 --> 00:13:44.657
No!

206
00:13:46.659 --> 00:13:47.618
Well...

207
00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.329
never mind.

208
00:13:49.704 --> 00:13:51.997
You know how
broad-minded we are!

209
00:13:51.998 --> 00:13:52.998
Of course.

210
00:13:52.999 --> 00:13:56.376
Okay, mom,
I have a test tomorrow so...

211
00:13:56.377 --> 00:13:57.545
I'll hang up now.

212
00:13:57.754 --> 00:13:58.838
Okay, bye.

213
00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.302
You don't talk to your father?

214
00:14:10.224 --> 00:14:11.017
Why?

215
00:14:12.518 --> 00:14:13.895
Long story.

216
00:14:14.896 --> 00:14:15.813
SQ?

217
00:14:17.607 --> 00:14:18.775
So... not today.

218
00:14:21.277 --> 00:14:23.946
What do your parents expect?
After graduation?

219
00:14:24.864 --> 00:14:25.948
I don't know.

220
00:14:26.866 --> 00:14:29.327
I just want to
earn a lot of money.

221
00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:31.245
And then?

222
00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:32.997
Then...

223
00:14:35.917 --> 00:14:37.043
Then I...

224
00:14:37.293 --> 00:14:39.461
actually want
to be a writer.

225
00:14:39.462 --> 00:14:40.587
Really?

226
00:14:40.588 --> 00:14:42.256
What will you write?

227
00:14:45.343 --> 00:14:47.345
Haven't thought about it...

228
00:14:48.012 --> 00:14:49.889
Simple things...

229
00:14:50.348 --> 00:14:52.683
Stories about
people like us...

230
00:14:53.351 --> 00:14:56.020
I don't want to preach...

231
00:14:56.813 --> 00:14:59.190
I just want to write good,
honest stories.

232
00:14:59.649 --> 00:15:02.110
Whether the story
has a hero or not...

233
00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:04.570
the story
should be the hero.

234
00:15:07.365 --> 00:15:08.783
I'm talking nonsense, right?

235
00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.618
Not really...

236
00:15:12.245 --> 00:15:13.454
And you?

237
00:15:14.872 --> 00:15:17.333
Mom thinks I can't
do anything...

238
00:15:17.875 --> 00:15:19.627
but most likely
a Marketing job.

239
00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:23.673
For now, I just need
to get good grades.

240
00:15:23.923 --> 00:15:25.258
Ohhh...

241
00:15:25.508 --> 00:15:28.010
So that's why you
made friends with me!

242
00:15:29.011 --> 00:15:30.304
Control yourself...

243
00:15:30.513 --> 00:15:32.974
You're not that
much of a genius.

244
00:15:33.266 --> 00:15:34.475
Qkay...

245
00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:39.105
- Goodnight.
- Goodnight.

246
00:15:42.775 --> 00:15:43.734
Krish!

247
00:15:45.653 --> 00:15:47.613
Your theory...

248
00:15:48.448 --> 00:15:51.367
The "Honest Story",
the "Hero" one...

249
00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.370
It's very good.

250
00:15:55.913 --> 00:15:57.457
I mean it!

251
00:15:59.375 --> 00:16:00.460
Bye.

252
00:16:05.047 --> 00:16:08.009
Maybe she was
interested in me...

253
00:16:09.802 --> 00:16:13.848
Now... Instead of being happy,
I panicked.

254
00:16:16.434 --> 00:16:19.437
I started behaving
like an idiot.

255
00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:21.814
Krish!

256
00:16:23.774 --> 00:16:25.276
B Plus.

257
00:16:26.736 --> 00:16:28.612
Your shorts are rather short.

258
00:16:28.613 --> 00:16:29.906
What did you get?

259
00:16:30.615 --> 00:16:31.948
A minus.

260
00:16:31.949 --> 00:16:32.783
How?!

261
00:16:32.992 --> 00:16:34.743
I am a gold medalist
in Economics!

262
00:16:34.744 --> 00:16:35.785
Do one thing...

263
00:16:35.786 --> 00:16:38.664
Go show your medal
to Professor Chatterjee.

264
00:16:38.998 --> 00:16:40.291
What's wrong with you?

265
00:16:40.958 --> 00:16:42.585
Nothing.
What could be wrong?

266
00:16:42.793 --> 00:16:44.462
Okay, come on, let's go out.

267
00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:45.963
I owe you a treat!

268
00:16:46.589 --> 00:16:47.964
Dressed like that?

269
00:16:47.965 --> 00:16:48.715
Yes!

270
00:16:48.716 --> 00:16:49.467
Why?

271
00:16:52.178 --> 00:16:53.554
Are you feeling shy?

272
00:16:53.763 --> 00:16:56.098
Aren't you?!
People are staring!

273
00:16:56.349 --> 00:16:58.517
These guys will
stare no matter what I wear!

274
00:16:58.518 --> 00:17:01.812
So you want to excite
people around here?!

275
00:17:03.314 --> 00:17:04.982
I don't want
to excite anybody!

276
00:17:05.233 --> 00:17:06.983
You llTians are
excited enough already!

277
00:17:06.984 --> 00:17:09.027
Looking at me obviously
excites you more...

278
00:17:09.028 --> 00:17:11.364
but I really can't
do anything about it.

279
00:17:12.406 --> 00:17:13.616
Krish! !!

280
00:17:14.033 --> 00:17:16.661
Are you serious?! You're
really not coming with me?

281
00:17:46.732 --> 00:17:50.695
"My naive, simple
heart was fine by itself"

282
00:17:50.903 --> 00:17:55.199
"And then you came along
and turned it on its head"

283
00:17:55.408 --> 00:17:57.493
"I was falling
in love with you"

284
00:17:57.785 --> 00:17:59.953
"But you said
we're just friends"

285
00:17:59.954 --> 00:18:01.956
"Desire coursed through me"

286
00:18:02.206 --> 00:18:04.124
"But I could do nothing..."

287
00:18:04.125 --> 00:18:05.793
"I can't escape"

288
00:18:06.252 --> 00:18:08.337
"Love is snapping at my heels"

289
00:18:08.588 --> 00:18:10.298
"Is this a comedy?"

290
00:18:10.798 --> 00:18:12.675
"Or a tragedy?"

291
00:18:13.676 --> 00:18:17.763
"Never wanted it,
now I'm stuck with it"

292
00:18:18.139 --> 00:18:21.183
"I'm confuzzled in love!"

293
00:18:29.358 --> 00:18:32.361
"I'm confuzzled in love!"

294
00:18:40.119 --> 00:18:41.829
"What an absurd state I'm in"

295
00:18:42.288 --> 00:18:44.206
"What is this mood God is in?"

296
00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:49.002
"Why does he gamble
away my heart?"

297
00:18:49.003 --> 00:18:53.257
"This pretense of friendship
feels like monotony"

298
00:18:53.507 --> 00:18:58.012
"And I play at it, even
though my heart's not in it"

299
00:19:07.605 --> 00:19:10.483
"I was doing fine by myself"

300
00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:16.030
"Now like a dead flower,
I wilt"

301
00:19:16.447 --> 00:19:19.533
"Used to be a dependable lad"

302
00:19:20.159 --> 00:19:24.455
"Now I'm as useful
as a dried up pen"

303
00:19:24.705 --> 00:19:29.168
"I lie awake at night"

304
00:19:29.377 --> 00:19:33.172
"You've stolen my sleep"

305
00:19:33.464 --> 00:19:35.132
"And when I do sleep"

306
00:19:35.383 --> 00:19:38.093
"There you are peeping"

307
00:19:38.094 --> 00:19:41.221
"From the windows
of my dreams"

308
00:19:41.222 --> 00:19:42.847
"So you tell
me- what do I do?'

309
00:19:42.848 --> 00:19:44.517
"I can't escape"

310
00:19:45.101 --> 00:19:46.894
"Love is snapping at my heels"

311
00:19:47.395 --> 00:19:49.021
"Is this a comedy?"

312
00:19:49.647 --> 00:19:51.399
"Or a tragedy?"

313
00:19:52.441 --> 00:19:56.654
"Never wanted it,
now I'm stuck with it"

314
00:19:56.987 --> 00:19:58.781
"I'm confuzzled in love!"

315
00:19:59.198 --> 00:20:00.908
I began to have nightmares...

316
00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.160
Ananya wanting to
make me her brother.

317
00:20:04.245 --> 00:20:07.205
I thought that I should
take care of things...

318
00:20:07.206 --> 00:20:09.917
before they
get out of hand.

319
00:20:12.545 --> 00:20:13.920
We have to stop
studying together!

320
00:20:13.921 --> 00:20:15.880
Huh? Suddenly?!
What happened!

321
00:20:15.881 --> 00:20:17.215
It's not you, it's me!

322
00:20:17.216 --> 00:20:20.261
What does "it's not you, it's
me" mean?! Please explain!

323
00:20:21.929 --> 00:20:24.181
Relax!
We're not getting divorced!

324
00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:26.016
We just can't study together!

325
00:20:26.267 --> 00:20:27.226
Krish!

326
00:20:29.937 --> 00:20:33.899
"My naive, simple
heart was fine by itself"

327
00:20:34.066 --> 00:20:38.404
"And then you came along
and turned it on its head"

328
00:20:40.865 --> 00:20:43.159
Want to go to
Rambhai's after class?

329
00:20:43.659 --> 00:20:44.577
No.

330
00:20:45.536 --> 00:20:47.121
I have to study.

331
00:20:50.666 --> 00:20:52.209
Are you both fighting?

332
00:20:52.752 --> 00:20:54.044
Mind your own business!

333
00:20:54.336 --> 00:20:57.965
"Never wanted it,
now I'm stuck with it"

334
00:20:59.008 --> 00:21:03.846
"I'm confuzzled in love!"

335
00:21:25.868 --> 00:21:28.829
Krish sir! Can you
spare 5 minutes, please?

336
00:21:29.663 --> 00:21:31.414
What is this childish
behaviour, Krish?

337
00:21:31.415 --> 00:21:34.250
Do you think your grades
will improve by ignoring me?

338
00:21:34.251 --> 00:21:35.711
Nothing like that.

339
00:21:36.086 --> 00:21:38.005
Krish! Eye contact!

340
00:21:42.718 --> 00:21:43.968
I can't do this!

341
00:21:43.969 --> 00:21:46.137
I can't keep up this
farce of 'friendship'.

342
00:21:46.138 --> 00:21:47.138
Look, I know...

343
00:21:47.139 --> 00:21:48.598
You're way out of my league.

344
00:21:48.599 --> 00:21:50.433
But I don't want to
be your llT brother, either!

345
00:21:50.434 --> 00:21:51.935
Okay, Krish, just calm down.

346
00:21:51.936 --> 00:21:52.977
No!

347
00:21:52.978 --> 00:21:55.481
I want you to
be my girlfriend.

348
00:21:58.108 --> 00:21:59.235
Sony..-

349
00:21:59.693 --> 00:22:04.114
This is why we
shouldn't hang out.

350
00:22:05.574 --> 00:22:06.367
But...

351
00:22:06.659 --> 00:22:07.575
Krish...

352
00:22:07.576 --> 00:22:09.494
I don't have any friends,
besides you...

353
00:22:09.495 --> 00:22:10.703
Same here!

354
00:22:10.704 --> 00:22:13.122
This is torture for me,
Ananya!

355
00:22:13.123 --> 00:22:15.792
Firstly, I hate Economics.

356
00:22:15.793 --> 00:22:18.795
Secondly, I'm in love with
the mole on your left cheek.

357
00:22:18.796 --> 00:22:22.132
It follows me around and
then I just want to kiss you!

358
00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:28.054
Forget it.
You won't understand.

359
00:22:28.055 --> 00:22:30.140
For you...
this is llT Proposal 55...

360
00:22:53.914 --> 00:22:54.747
Sorry!

361
00:22:54.748 --> 00:22:56.457
We were just looking
for our Frisbee.

362
00:22:56.458 --> 00:22:58.168
There's nothing here!

363
00:22:58.502 --> 00:23:00.880
This boy only studies!

364
00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:09.513
Krish!

365
00:23:10.806 --> 00:23:13.767
You're thinking way ahead.

366
00:23:14.101 --> 00:23:15.436
Please stop!

367
00:23:15.603 --> 00:23:17.813
Not that ahead...
Why should I stop?

368
00:23:17.980 --> 00:23:20.065
Behave yourself.
You're getting nothing.

369
00:23:20.232 --> 00:23:23.318
Nothing else or...
not even as much as yesterday?

370
00:23:23.319 --> 00:23:26.030
Do guys only think
about one thing?

371
00:23:26.238 --> 00:23:27.531
Well... yes.

372
00:23:28.198 --> 00:23:31.618
We have to finish that
Normal Curve chapter tonight!

373
00:23:31.619 --> 00:23:33.203
Which... curve?

374
00:23:35.122 --> 00:23:36.832
Tell me at least!

375
00:23:41.587 --> 00:23:43.421
Was this your first time?

376
00:23:43.422 --> 00:23:45.049
Yeah... with you.

377
00:23:45.424 --> 00:23:47.927
You mean you had
a girlfriend before?

378
00:23:48.427 --> 00:23:49.928
Please take down these photos...

379
00:23:49.929 --> 00:23:52.514
It feels like your parents are
watching us.

380
00:23:52.723 --> 00:23:55.517
You never mentioned
this 'girlfriend' before...

381
00:23:55.768 --> 00:23:57.019
Long story...

382
00:23:57.227 --> 00:23:59.313
Oh God, Krish!

383
00:23:59.813 --> 00:24:02.566
You have too many
'long stories'!

384
00:24:07.655 --> 00:24:08.614
Rashmi.

385
00:24:09.782 --> 00:24:11.075
In college.

386
00:24:11.408 --> 00:24:12.952
Principal's daughter.

387
00:24:13.243 --> 00:24:14.703
Then what happened?

388
00:24:15.037 --> 00:24:17.205
Then what? I'm here.

389
00:24:17.206 --> 00:24:19.041
She's probably
happily married...

390
00:24:19.416 --> 00:24:21.293
Did you love her?

391
00:24:22.461 --> 00:24:24.295
Sometimes I think that...

392
00:24:24.296 --> 00:24:26.507
If I was a little braver...

393
00:24:28.384 --> 00:24:30.928
Things would have
been different today.

394
00:24:35.057 --> 00:24:36.057
Now, enough.

395
00:24:36.058 --> 00:24:38.435
Last question!
Was she pretty?

396
00:24:39.645 --> 00:24:40.728
Not at all!

397
00:24:40.729 --> 00:24:42.648
- Punjabi?
- No...

398
00:24:46.318 --> 00:24:47.443
You know...

399
00:24:47.444 --> 00:24:49.988
My parents are
very conservative.

400
00:24:49.989 --> 00:24:52.324
It's not like we're
getting married!

401
00:24:53.158 --> 00:24:54.201
Right.

402
00:24:54.535 --> 00:24:56.577
We're just messing around...

403
00:24:56.578 --> 00:24:58.622
Like...
Friends with Benefits!

404
00:24:59.248 --> 00:25:01.667
Ananya...
That's not what I meant!

405
00:25:02.334 --> 00:25:03.585
Sony..-

406
00:25:03.752 --> 00:25:06.296
I'm over-reacting...
Sorry!

407
00:25:09.675 --> 00:25:10.634
Ananya!

408
00:25:11.802 --> 00:25:13.011
Ananya!

409
00:25:13.012 --> 00:25:15.139
- What?
- I love you.

410
00:25:18.183 --> 00:25:20.352
What?!
You don't believe me?

411
00:25:20.936 --> 00:25:22.353
Not at all.

412
00:25:22.354 --> 00:25:25.482
You're just scared I'll
stop sleeping with you.

413
00:25:25.649 --> 00:25:26.858
Well... that too.

414
00:25:26.859 --> 00:25:28.026
No, but, honestly!

415
00:25:28.027 --> 00:25:29.485
We spend all
our time together.

416
00:25:29.486 --> 00:25:33.157
Even when we're not together,
I only think about you!

417
00:25:34.575 --> 00:25:36.118
It's clear, right?

418
00:25:36.285 --> 00:25:37.619
I love you!

419
00:25:38.162 --> 00:25:39.454
Good.

420
00:25:39.455 --> 00:25:40.831
Now, it sounds convincing.

421
00:25:43.625 --> 00:25:45.919
Hey wait! And you?

422
00:25:46.628 --> 00:25:49.840
What about me?
I'm just using you for grades!

423
00:25:50.132 --> 00:25:51.258
Oh, really...

424
00:25:52.801 --> 00:25:54.553
Well, use me properly!

425
00:26:06.190 --> 00:26:11.653
"My heart is at
odds with my head"

426
00:26:13.572 --> 00:26:19.244
"How did love sneak
in and catch us unawares?"

427
00:26:20.245 --> 00:26:22.163
"A little bit of a rascal"

428
00:26:22.164 --> 00:26:23.956
"But kind of helpless, too"

429
00:26:23.957 --> 00:26:25.751
"Love's a devil"

430
00:26:25.918 --> 00:26:30.089
"But a lovable devil, it is"

431
00:26:31.548 --> 00:26:35.259
"Offo!
Should I chase it away?"

432
00:26:35.260 --> 00:26:38.888
"Offo!
Or should I hold it in embrace?"

433
00:26:38.889 --> 00:26:42.476
"Offo!
Should I chase it away?"

434
00:26:42.684 --> 00:26:46.438
"Offo!
Or should I hold it in embrace?"

435
00:26:46.688 --> 00:26:48.314
"Should I wield
it like I'm proud?"

436
00:26:48.315 --> 00:26:52.069
"Or slap it away?
Offo!"

437
00:27:01.578 --> 00:27:03.872
"Look here it is...

438
00:27:05.249 --> 00:27:07.334
with pocketfuls
of mischief"

439
00:27:09.002 --> 00:27:14.675
"Just like you,
it's quirky too"

440
00:27:15.884 --> 00:27:19.221
"it's impulsive,
but it's thoughtful too"

441
00:27:19.429 --> 00:27:24.518
"A little decent and
a little shameless too"

442
00:27:26.979 --> 00:27:30.524
"Offo!
Should I chase it away?"

443
00:27:30.732 --> 00:27:34.153
"Offo!
Or should I hold it in embrace?"

444
00:27:34.403 --> 00:27:37.823
"Offo!
Should I chase it away?"

445
00:27:38.073 --> 00:27:41.577
"Offo!
Or should I hold it in embrace?"

446
00:27:42.161 --> 00:27:43.911
"Should I wield
it like I'm proud?"

447
00:27:43.912 --> 00:27:47.040
"Or slap it away?
Offo!"

448
00:28:04.474 --> 00:28:09.313
"Crossed every
line of astonishment"

449
00:28:11.815 --> 00:28:16.945
"Acting silly when
I'm in my senses, too"

450
00:28:19.239 --> 00:28:24.369
"What started as a
joke is now an obsession"

451
00:28:26.663 --> 00:28:31.752
"A rather expensive
obsession, too"

452
00:28:33.545 --> 00:28:37.007
"Love caresses my shoulders
like it's just a friend"

453
00:28:37.299 --> 00:28:40.594
"But grabs every chance
to show what it really is"

454
00:28:40.761 --> 00:28:44.180
"Past every limit
is this gesture of love"

455
00:28:44.181 --> 00:28:46.016
"Love's a devil"

456
00:28:46.225 --> 00:28:50.187
"But a lovable devil, it is"

457
00:28:52.022 --> 00:28:55.484
"Offo!
Should I chase it away?"

458
00:28:55.734 --> 00:28:59.403
"Offo!
Or should I hold it in embrace?"

459
00:28:59.404 --> 00:29:03.074
"Offo!
Should I chase it away?"

460
00:29:03.075 --> 00:29:06.495
"Offo!
Or should I hold it in embrace?"

461
00:29:06.703 --> 00:29:08.497
"Should I wield
it like I'm proud?"

462
00:29:08.747 --> 00:29:11.917
"Or slap it away?
Offo!"

463
00:29:14.086 --> 00:29:15.504
noffo!"

464
00:29:17.881 --> 00:29:19.174
noffo!"

465
00:29:21.551 --> 00:29:22.678
noffo!"

466
00:29:24.221 --> 00:29:27.056
I just hope to make
some good money...

467
00:29:27.057 --> 00:29:28.892
And then writing?

468
00:29:31.186 --> 00:29:33.313
I don't know what I'll write,
though...

469
00:29:33.897 --> 00:29:36.942
Write your tragic
love story with Rashmi!

470
00:29:37.234 --> 00:29:38.777
Not cool, Ananya...

471
00:29:38.944 --> 00:29:41.154
We agreed not
to talk about it.

472
00:29:41.363 --> 00:29:44.574
I'm serious!
Tragedy's the new cool!

473
00:29:45.117 --> 00:29:47.536
The critics will be happy!

474
00:29:52.249 --> 00:29:53.165
Krish...

475
00:29:53.166 --> 00:29:54.126
Hmm.

476
00:29:57.879 --> 00:29:59.464
I love you.

477
00:30:02.509 --> 00:30:04.302
What's gotten into you?

478
00:30:04.303 --> 00:30:05.720
Nothing...

479
00:30:05.721 --> 00:30:07.471
I've been thinking about it...

480
00:30:07.472 --> 00:30:09.182
so I said it.

481
00:30:24.406 --> 00:30:25.073
Krish...

482
00:30:26.825 --> 00:30:28.452
are you asleep?

483
00:30:29.703 --> 00:30:31.747
No... say.

484
00:30:31.997 --> 00:30:34.291
Placements start in 10 days...

485
00:30:34.499 --> 00:30:38.295
Superb, isn't it?
You'll get a great job.

486
00:30:38.712 --> 00:30:40.338
Forget the job, Krish...

487
00:30:40.339 --> 00:30:43.300
In 4 weeks we'll
be in different cities.

488
00:30:43.592 --> 00:30:46.887
So what? I'll just
find a job wherever you are.

489
00:30:47.095 --> 00:30:48.846
That's not in
our control, Krish!

490
00:30:48.847 --> 00:30:50.556
Why are you worried?

491
00:30:50.557 --> 00:30:53.059
We'll see where fate takes us...

492
00:30:53.060 --> 00:30:54.143
No!

493
00:30:54.144 --> 00:30:55.394
The issue is, where do YOU want...

494
00:30:55.395 --> 00:30:57.647
to take this relationship?

495
00:30:57.898 --> 00:31:00.024
Let's not have this
conversation now. Please, come.

496
00:31:00.025 --> 00:31:01.818
If not now, then when, Krish?

497
00:31:02.319 --> 00:31:03.904
Ananya...

498
00:31:07.074 --> 00:31:08.992
I'm not saying no...

499
00:31:09.826 --> 00:31:11.494
I just need some time.

500
00:31:11.495 --> 00:31:13.789
Weren't 2 years enough, Krish?

501
00:31:15.374 --> 00:31:18.043
This is what's
great about you guys.

502
00:31:18.335 --> 00:31:20.587
It takes you no time
to jump into bed...

503
00:31:20.754 --> 00:31:24.424
but when it comes to commitment,
you need time to think!

504
00:31:27.636 --> 00:31:29.012
Ananya!

505
00:32:01.670 --> 00:32:03.255
Final question...

506
00:32:04.297 --> 00:32:06.800
Why do you want
to work with our bank?

507
00:32:07.717 --> 00:32:09.051
Because, Sir...

508
00:32:09.052 --> 00:32:10.887
Your bank is the best.

509
00:32:11.096 --> 00:32:15.641
Mr. Malhotra, we want a
candidate with a 7-point grade...

510
00:32:15.642 --> 00:32:17.352
which you don't have.

511
00:32:17.602 --> 00:32:20.897
Nevertheless...
give us 5 minutes?

512
00:32:45.755 --> 00:32:46.923
I felt suffocated.

513
00:32:48.341 --> 00:32:52.345
I couldn't answer the girl
I had loved for two years...

514
00:32:52.596 --> 00:32:57.809
And I was waiting for an answer
for a job I didn't care about.

515
00:32:58.351 --> 00:33:00.103
What was I doing?!

516
00:33:09.154 --> 00:33:10.654
And more so, sir...

517
00:33:10.655 --> 00:33:13.867
Sunsilk depicts the modern,
confident woman, who no matter what-

518
00:33:17.871 --> 00:33:19.039
Yes?

519
00:33:19.247 --> 00:33:20.707
Sorry, sir.

520
00:33:21.374 --> 00:33:23.710
I have something important
to discuss with her.

521
00:33:23.919 --> 00:33:27.505
Her interview is on...
Can't you wait?

522
00:33:27.506 --> 00:33:28.632
No, sir. Sorry.

523
00:33:28.882 --> 00:33:30.383
I only need a minute.

524
00:33:37.140 --> 00:33:38.641
How's the interview going?

525
00:33:38.642 --> 00:33:41.561
Krish Malhotra,
this better be important!

526
00:33:43.438 --> 00:33:45.148
Ananya Swaminathan...

527
00:33:45.565 --> 00:33:49.444
I've never loved
anyone like this before.

528
00:33:50.904 --> 00:33:53.365
I want to marry you.

529
00:33:54.491 --> 00:33:56.076
Marry me?

530
00:33:56.910 --> 00:33:58.036
Please?

531
00:34:03.166 --> 00:34:05.168
Is everything okay?

532
00:34:06.836 --> 00:34:08.046
Yes, sir...

533
00:34:12.509 --> 00:34:13.843
Now what?

534
00:34:14.553 --> 00:34:16.179
Now.. say yes?

535
00:34:19.224 --> 00:34:20.559
Yes!

536
00:34:21.643 --> 00:34:23.395
Now go...
or I won't get the job.

537
00:34:23.562 --> 00:34:25.522
Okay! All the best!

538
00:34:37.367 --> 00:34:39.035
Sorry, sir...

539
00:34:41.079 --> 00:34:42.956
So, as I was saying...

540
00:34:43.248 --> 00:34:44.623
Sunsilk...

541
00:34:44.624 --> 00:34:47.836
And the confident woman...

542
00:34:48.211 --> 00:34:49.462
Girl...

543
00:34:51.214 --> 00:34:52.756
Why are you wearing slippers?!

544
00:34:52.757 --> 00:34:56.385
Forget the slippers... Why
did you bring so many sweets?

545
00:34:56.386 --> 00:34:58.597
Shipra, Guddo, Rajji...

546
00:34:58.805 --> 00:35:01.348
everyone wanted to come!
You're the one who told them not to.

547
00:35:01.349 --> 00:35:04.352
They've all sent
boxfuls of love to you!

548
00:35:05.478 --> 00:35:07.606
And why have you
become so thin?

549
00:35:07.939 --> 00:35:09.231
Mom... Come on. Let's go.

550
00:35:09.232 --> 00:35:15.488
This was bound to happen... Who can
survive only on vegetarian food?!

551
00:35:15.697 --> 00:35:19.451
- Vastrapur road, please.
- Hold this.

552
00:35:22.537 --> 00:35:23.871
Mom...

553
00:35:23.872 --> 00:35:26.081
I want you to meet someone.

554
00:35:26.082 --> 00:35:27.208
Who?

555
00:35:27.792 --> 00:35:29.336
A girl.

556
00:35:30.128 --> 00:35:31.546
A Qirl?

557
00:35:31.880 --> 00:35:33.923
Are you in relationship?!

558
00:35:34.090 --> 00:35:37.051
No, mom...
She's just a very good friend.

559
00:35:37.052 --> 00:35:38.677
Friends are always very good.

560
00:35:38.678 --> 00:35:41.431
If they were bad,
they wouldn't be our friends.

561
00:35:41.890 --> 00:35:43.265
Her name is Ananya...

562
00:35:43.266 --> 00:35:45.560
She's got a great
marketing job with Sunsilk!

563
00:35:45.727 --> 00:35:50.732
Really! Sunsilk shampoo! Can
she send us half a dozen cartons?

564
00:35:50.899 --> 00:35:56.196
Mom, please don't talk like a middle
class woman. You will embarrass me.

565
00:35:56.446 --> 00:35:59.949
Stop the rickshaw!
Turn it around! Turn!

566
00:36:00.158 --> 00:36:04.663
I was foolishly excited to
come for your conversation!

567
00:36:05.789 --> 00:36:11.419
Slogged like a donkey to
find all these sweets for you!

568
00:36:11.628 --> 00:36:16.633
Why did I come if all I do is embarrass
you in front of your friends?!

569
00:36:17.425 --> 00:36:19.510
Girls only cause
fights at home.

570
00:36:19.511 --> 00:36:21.679
See? He's absolutely right!

571
00:36:21.680 --> 00:36:23.473
You please just drive ahead.

572
00:36:27.227 --> 00:36:28.269
Mom...

573
00:36:29.813 --> 00:36:31.147
Listen to me...

574
00:36:32.065 --> 00:36:34.317
That's not what I meant...

575
00:36:35.193 --> 00:36:41.241
I've told Ananya so many stories
about you, she's dying to meet you!

576
00:36:42.242 --> 00:36:44.202
By the way, Krish...

577
00:36:44.703 --> 00:36:47.080
Did you tell her
everything about us?

578
00:36:47.372 --> 00:36:48.707
No...

579
00:36:49.457 --> 00:36:52.919
Just how hard you've
worked to raise me.

580
00:36:53.420 --> 00:36:55.338
And how beautiful you are...

581
00:36:58.049 --> 00:37:01.636
Leave the butter
for your food!

582
00:37:04.597 --> 00:37:06.766
Listen, sir!

583
00:37:07.100 --> 00:37:08.809
What do Gujaratis
eat for dessert?

584
00:37:08.810 --> 00:37:10.186
Sweet Lentils?

585
00:37:23.908 --> 00:37:25.368
Mom... Ananya.

586
00:37:25.702 --> 00:37:27.245
Hello, Aunty!

587
00:37:27.662 --> 00:37:28.830
Hello...

588
00:37:29.789 --> 00:37:31.874
Krish is always
talking about you!

589
00:37:31.875 --> 00:37:36.337
Really? Since I arrived, he's
been talking only about you.

590
00:37:36.504 --> 00:37:37.546
Shall we sit, Mom?

591
00:37:37.547 --> 00:37:38.548
Here?

592
00:37:38.757 --> 00:37:40.507
Ananya... Where's Aunty?

593
00:37:40.508 --> 00:37:43.469
She's on her way... You know how
long she takes to wear her sari!

594
00:37:43.470 --> 00:37:44.888
Oh, yes...

595
00:37:45.597 --> 00:37:48.808
Since when do you know
so much about saris?

596
00:37:53.730 --> 00:37:54.689
Oh!

597
00:37:57.901 --> 00:38:01.404
Oh God! They're Madrasis!

598
00:38:02.447 --> 00:38:03.655
Tamilian.

599
00:38:03.656 --> 00:38:05.867
Same thing.

600
00:38:06.409 --> 00:38:08.703
Okay, mom. Come quickly!

601
00:38:12.415 --> 00:38:14.584
Mum... Dad... This is Krish.

602
00:38:14.751 --> 00:38:16.377
And his mom.

603
00:38:22.759 --> 00:38:23.968
Manju.

604
00:38:25.804 --> 00:38:28.473
I'm so happy we're
all together.

605
00:38:31.351 --> 00:38:33.393
Where's Krish's father?

606
00:38:33.394 --> 00:38:37.315
He has a heart problem.
He can't travel.

607
00:38:38.942 --> 00:38:40.276
Oh.

608
00:38:43.863 --> 00:38:45.114
<i>OKQY -</i>

609
00:38:45.323 --> 00:38:46.616
I'll see you.

610
00:38:53.248 --> 00:38:56.208
What kind of father misses
his own son's convocation?

611
00:38:56.209 --> 00:38:58.294
Let it go, Radha.

612
00:38:59.712 --> 00:39:02.131
- They let Madrasis study here?
- Mom!

613
00:39:03.424 --> 00:39:06.928
I have to go join the line.
Please talk to them.

614
00:39:07.136 --> 00:39:10.348
In which language?
I don't speak Madrasi.

615
00:39:10.598 --> 00:39:12.641
We are all going for
lunch together tomorrow.

616
00:39:12.642 --> 00:39:16.187
You can go if you want to.
I'll eat alone.

617
00:39:22.902 --> 00:39:23.944
So...

618
00:39:23.945 --> 00:39:26.488
Aunty... How does it feel?
Are you excited?

619
00:39:26.489 --> 00:39:30.702
Yes... but this is what
we expected from Ananya!

620
00:39:31.202 --> 00:39:32.453
Oh. good.

621
00:39:37.709 --> 00:39:38.668
Uncle...

622
00:39:40.211 --> 00:39:41.921
How long are you staying?

623
00:39:42.589 --> 00:39:43.631
Two days.

624
00:39:44.007 --> 00:39:45.091
Why?

625
00:39:45.383 --> 00:39:47.510
I was thinking...

626
00:39:47.844 --> 00:39:49.928
we could hire a car
and go sight seeing tomorrow?

627
00:39:49.929 --> 00:39:50.930
No.

628
00:39:51.180 --> 00:39:53.849
We can go see Gandhi Ashram?

629
00:39:53.850 --> 00:39:56.351
Yes! Very good idea, Aunty!
Gandhi Ashram! Done!

630
00:39:56.352 --> 00:39:57.645
Okay, Mom? Gandhi Ashram!

631
00:39:57.812 --> 00:40:00.773
What's there in Gandhi Ashram?!
I don't want to go.

632
00:40:01.941 --> 00:40:03.525
Typical Punjabi.

633
00:40:03.526 --> 00:40:07.405
All money, no class.
Uncultured people.

634
00:40:07.906 --> 00:40:09.866
Uncultured and us?!

635
00:40:10.158 --> 00:40:12.367
These Madrasis are
the uncultured ones!

636
00:40:12.368 --> 00:40:14.620
What?!
What did you say?

637
00:40:14.621 --> 00:40:17.581
Nothing, Aunty!
Mom, please, control!

638
00:40:17.582 --> 00:40:21.210
Control? These Madrasis
should control their daughters!

639
00:40:21.377 --> 00:40:23.378
Look at all the
Madrasi heroines...

640
00:40:23.379 --> 00:40:25.380
each one has trapped
a Punjabi boy!

641
00:40:25.381 --> 00:40:28.092
Control!
Why should I control?

642
00:40:30.136 --> 00:40:32.221
Come on, let's go! Come on!!!

643
00:40:32.513 --> 00:40:33.723
What happened?

644
00:40:42.106 --> 00:40:44.484
I'm telling the truth!

645
00:40:45.109 --> 00:40:47.236
Krish! Let's go!

646
00:40:56.829 --> 00:40:59.666
Thank Goodness you didn't
touch their feet instead!

647
00:41:16.015 --> 00:41:17.433
Krish!

648
00:41:19.352 --> 00:41:20.561
Love you!

649
00:41:20.770 --> 00:41:24.607
That day,
I watched my mother graduate.

650
00:41:25.358 --> 00:41:27.026
She was so happy“-

651
00:41:27.485 --> 00:41:29.904
She forgot all her problems...

652
00:41:31.990 --> 00:41:35.868
But by then, Ananya's
parents had a problem.

653
00:41:51.426 --> 00:41:54.594
What are you staring
at that for? Just write Delhi.

654
00:41:54.595 --> 00:41:57.515
There's no need
to go anywhere else.

655
00:41:57.765 --> 00:42:01.184
I had a few days off
before the job started...

656
00:42:01.185 --> 00:42:03.021
so I went home.

657
00:42:03.396 --> 00:42:05.398
Things were tense...

658
00:42:05.606 --> 00:42:10.069
Neither mom nor Ananya's
family had forgotten the fight.

659
00:42:11.904 --> 00:42:12.447
Hi!

660
00:42:12.739 --> 00:42:13.864
Phone sex?

661
00:42:13.865 --> 00:42:14.782
What?!

662
00:42:17.285 --> 00:42:20.704
Today's my first day at Sunsilk!
It's a great office...

663
00:42:20.705 --> 00:42:22.415
I'm very excited!

664
00:42:23.332 --> 00:42:26.002
You're applying
to Chennai... right?

665
00:42:26.210 --> 00:42:29.297
Mom wants me to
stay in Delhi...

666
00:42:29.672 --> 00:42:32.675
You know I'd come there
if I had an option...

667
00:42:32.842 --> 00:42:34.927
Please come! I miss you!

668
00:42:35.428 --> 00:42:36.845
I'll figure it out.

669
00:42:36.846 --> 00:42:37.846
Good.

670
00:42:37.847 --> 00:42:38.806
I love you.

671
00:42:39.140 --> 00:42:40.308
Hmm.

672
00:42:41.059 --> 00:42:42.059
No.

673
00:42:42.060 --> 00:42:43.811
You have to say it.

674
00:42:44.062 --> 00:42:45.854
Mom's watching...

675
00:42:45.855 --> 00:42:47.440
Hard luck. Say it.

676
00:42:51.694 --> 00:42:52.904
I..-

677
00:42:54.280 --> 00:42:55.948
love...

678
00:42:56.949 --> 00:42:57.867
VOu...

679
00:42:58.034 --> 00:42:59.284
Zing! This new app.

680
00:42:59.285 --> 00:43:02.163
I'll message you the name.
Download it.

681
00:43:02.455 --> 00:43:06.626
Very bad, Krish! Please think
of something better next time!

682
00:43:10.088 --> 00:43:11.255
Okay. Bye.

683
00:43:13.508 --> 00:43:15.634
Ananya! What did he say?

684
00:43:15.635 --> 00:43:16.803
Nothing.

685
00:43:17.386 --> 00:43:19.514
Beware of that Madrasan.

686
00:43:20.014 --> 00:43:22.265
They're experts
at brainwashing boys!

687
00:43:22.266 --> 00:43:23.851
Mom, her name is Ananya.

688
00:43:24.102 --> 00:43:25.560
And I love her.

689
00:43:25.561 --> 00:43:27.604
She's making a fool of you!

690
00:43:27.605 --> 00:43:30.482
She's successful, has a good job.
Why would she fool me?

691
00:43:30.483 --> 00:43:32.067
Look. We Punjabis are...

692
00:43:32.068 --> 00:43:33.777
fair and good looking.

693
00:43:33.778 --> 00:43:35.571
And these Madrasis... Dark.

694
00:43:35.780 --> 00:43:37.490
They're jealous of us!

695
00:43:37.698 --> 00:43:41.536
Have you seen Ananya?
She's fairer than me!

696
00:43:41.828 --> 00:43:45.664
These fair skinned Madrasans
are even more dangerous!

697
00:43:45.665 --> 00:43:47.082
What nonsense!

698
00:43:47.083 --> 00:43:49.544
Sorry, Mom! Sorry!

699
00:43:49.794 --> 00:43:52.003
Today, it's just my finger...

700
00:43:52.004 --> 00:43:53.964
it's going to
be my throat tomorrow!

701
00:43:53.965 --> 00:43:55.423
Okay, Mom... relax.

702
00:43:55.424 --> 00:43:57.635
I'll apply to Delhi.

703
00:43:58.261 --> 00:43:59.929
- Promise?
- Promise.

704
00:44:00.596 --> 00:44:01.889
Happy?

705
00:44:02.807 --> 00:44:04.392
Now, where are the band-aids?

706
00:44:04.642 --> 00:44:05.935
There.

707
00:44:08.521 --> 00:44:09.981
Writer?!

708
00:44:10.231 --> 00:44:14.568
So, you're going to wander around
in your khadi kurta, with a ratty bag?

709
00:44:14.569 --> 00:44:17.905
It's that Madrasan's doing.
She's going to ruin your life!

710
00:44:18.114 --> 00:44:20.867
Tell him! He shouldn't
repeat your mistakes!

711
00:44:21.075 --> 00:44:24.369
What did you gain from this love
marriage? Besides fighting?

712
00:44:24.370 --> 00:44:27.873
We'll find a nice, educated
girl for Krish... Right?

713
00:44:27.874 --> 00:44:30.542
I already found a nice,
educated girl, Mom.

714
00:44:30.543 --> 00:44:32.210
But she's a Madrasan!

715
00:44:32.211 --> 00:44:33.378
<i>'</i> $0?
<i>'</i> 30?!

716
00:44:33.379 --> 00:44:37.717
What if tomorrow you want to marry an
Assamese or Oriya girl? Unacceptable!

717
00:44:37.925 --> 00:44:40.553
Great. He's here.

718
00:44:45.516 --> 00:44:47.852
Hello, brother-in-law.

719
00:44:52.398 --> 00:44:54.734
I said hello, brother-in-law.

720
00:44:55.484 --> 00:44:57.027
What are you doing here?

721
00:44:57.028 --> 00:44:59.697
What do you mean?
My sister invited me.

722
00:44:59.906 --> 00:45:04.493
Great. One wretch has come to cry
over the wretchedness of another.

723
00:45:08.414 --> 00:45:12.877
I haven't come her to be humiliated!
I don't know how you stand it!

724
00:45:13.127 --> 00:45:15.087
This is the limit.

725
00:45:15.463 --> 00:45:16.714
Look, son.

726
00:45:17.256 --> 00:45:19.008
You should meet Dolly...

727
00:45:19.383 --> 00:45:21.302
She's a nice girl for you.

728
00:45:22.053 --> 00:45:23.261
Look at them.

729
00:45:23.262 --> 00:45:27.183
Even the greatest
love fades over time.

730
00:45:27.683 --> 00:45:28.808
<i>OKQY -</i>

731
00:45:28.809 --> 00:45:31.354
Be well. Take care.

732
00:45:32.897 --> 00:45:34.565
Who's Dolly?

733
00:45:35.900 --> 00:45:37.693
Who is Dolly?

734
00:45:38.527 --> 00:45:41.030
- Is he looking for girls?
- Yes.

735
00:45:42.865 --> 00:45:44.242
Why wasn't I told?

736
00:45:44.408 --> 00:45:48.537
What is it to you? Don't
feign interest in our lives.

737
00:45:49.038 --> 00:45:50.623
We're not used to it.

738
00:45:51.332 --> 00:45:53.792
You and your family
have corrupted his mind!

739
00:45:53.793 --> 00:45:55.962
Not to her, speak to me!

740
00:45:56.462 --> 00:45:58.214
Don't even think about it.

741
00:46:05.596 --> 00:46:07.014
Krish, go inside.

742
00:46:07.431 --> 00:46:08.682
Krish, go!

743
00:46:08.683 --> 00:46:10.476
First tell him to leave.

744
00:46:10.893 --> 00:46:15.355
Krish, go to your room!
Mind the glass...

745
00:46:15.356 --> 00:46:17.275
Just go, Krish!

746
00:46:38.838 --> 00:46:42.800
Every time you reconcile,
he acts out again.

747
00:46:43.884 --> 00:46:45.636
Just let the glass be!

748
00:46:46.595 --> 00:46:49.432
It'll cut his feet,
and he'll learn a lesson.

749
00:46:50.182 --> 00:46:52.560
But what if you cut your foot?

750
00:46:56.063 --> 00:46:58.149
Why don't you just leave him?

751
00:46:59.191 --> 00:47:01.527
It's not that simple, Krish...

752
00:47:02.528 --> 00:47:03.821
Anyway...

753
00:47:04.071 --> 00:47:06.115
He only comes here to sleep.

754
00:47:06.782 --> 00:47:08.492
What difference does it make?

755
00:47:12.455 --> 00:47:15.665
Wasn't he going to
open a security firm?

756
00:47:15.666 --> 00:47:17.376
What happened?

757
00:47:18.794 --> 00:47:23.090
He punched the only
willing financer.

758
00:47:26.510 --> 00:47:29.138
I'm used to him, Krish.

759
00:47:30.973 --> 00:47:34.310
But I'm scared
of your temper now.

760
00:47:35.186 --> 00:47:39.523
Once your job is fixed,
stay at the company's accommodation.

761
00:47:39.857 --> 00:47:41.608
I'll handle things here.

762
00:47:41.609 --> 00:47:43.526
Then why should
I stay in Delhi?

763
00:47:43.527 --> 00:47:45.028
- Meaning?
- I mean...

764
00:47:45.029 --> 00:47:47.655
I'll earn well,
Mom, let's get out of here!

765
00:47:47.656 --> 00:47:50.242
I'm not going to leave Delhi.

766
00:47:50.493 --> 00:47:53.120
At least, my relatives
are here.

767
00:47:55.498 --> 00:47:56.707
Mom...

768
00:47:58.959 --> 00:48:01.545
Mom, I want to go to Chennai.

769
00:48:07.301 --> 00:48:09.261
I'm calling Rajji at once...

770
00:48:09.512 --> 00:48:14.517
Only a priest can save
my son from that witch now.

771
00:48:33.661 --> 00:48:36.079
- Patti-nakka-pakkam?
- Pattinampakkam.

772
00:48:36.080 --> 00:48:40.667
Yeah! Next to Annai
Velankanni church?

773
00:48:40.668 --> 00:48:41.710
YES yes!

774
00:48:43.921 --> 00:48:46.047
Sorry, I couldn't pick you up.

775
00:48:46.048 --> 00:48:48.759
I'm in Vizag for
2 days.

776
00:48:49.009 --> 00:48:52.721
By the way... Welcome
to my city, Mr. Malhotra!

777
00:48:53.264 --> 00:48:54.557
Thanks for coming.

778
00:48:54.807 --> 00:48:56.266
I've missed you.

779
00:48:56.267 --> 00:48:57.601
Very much.

780
00:49:00.438 --> 00:49:04.233
You'll see half of Chennai
on your way to your apartment.

781
00:49:04.567 --> 00:49:07.611
No one here knows Hindi,
so don't even try.

782
00:49:07.778 --> 00:49:09.405
Use actions.

783
00:49:09.697 --> 00:49:12.074
It's the least you can
do for the love of your life!

784
00:49:12.783 --> 00:49:16.662
"I found love in you"

785
00:49:17.746 --> 00:49:21.667
"And I ran to your city"

786
00:49:23.043 --> 00:49:25.421
"I long to see you"

787
00:49:25.671 --> 00:49:28.173
"My heart says your name"

788
00:49:28.174 --> 00:49:31.927
"I have come to be one with you"

789
00:49:33.387 --> 00:49:35.681
"I long to see you"

790
00:49:35.931 --> 00:49:38.309
"My heart says your name"

791
00:49:40.519 --> 00:49:43.105
My office is not too
far from your apartment...

792
00:49:43.397 --> 00:49:44.898
if you know what I mean.

793
00:49:44.899 --> 00:49:47.234
"I found love in you"

794
00:49:48.402 --> 00:49:52.239
"And I ran to your city"

795
00:49:57.077 --> 00:49:59.287
Shobha Aunty from
Texas is here.

796
00:49:59.288 --> 00:50:00.623
Dinner at my place day after.

797
00:50:00.789 --> 00:50:02.208
Or we won't get to meet.

798
00:50:02.750 --> 00:50:03.918
Can't wait to see you!

799
00:50:06.754 --> 00:50:09.673
Oh, and mom's having trouble
finding a music teacher...

800
00:50:09.965 --> 00:50:11.842
so she's a little
upset these days.

801
00:50:14.011 --> 00:50:15.678
Also, please don't be late.

802
00:50:15.679 --> 00:50:17.139
You have to impress the in-laws!

803
00:50:17.598 --> 00:50:18.724
Love you.

804
00:50:26.315 --> 00:50:27.566
Hello, sir.

805
00:50:28.150 --> 00:50:29.193
Krish.

806
00:50:31.153 --> 00:50:32.863
Ananya's friend...?

807
00:50:34.073 --> 00:50:35.532
Come... come...

808
00:50:35.533 --> 00:50:36.992
Take off your shoes!

809
00:50:38.160 --> 00:50:40.996
Be careful of the rangoli!

810
00:50:56.845 --> 00:50:58.556
Their house was so quiet...

811
00:50:58.973 --> 00:51:01.225
Like we were at a funeral!

812
00:51:02.726 --> 00:51:05.854
Ananya's parents don't
believe in furniture.

813
00:51:06.313 --> 00:51:08.857
Their living room
looked like...

814
00:51:09.108 --> 00:51:11.901
a Punjabi home
that was robbed.

815
00:51:11.902 --> 00:51:14.822
The robbers didn't like the
sofa, so they left it behind.

816
00:51:15.823 --> 00:51:17.073
Sir...

817
00:51:17.074 --> 00:51:18.449
your house is lovely.

818
00:51:18.450 --> 00:51:21.495
What lovely?
No running water.

819
00:51:21.662 --> 00:51:23.622
Only 3 hours in the morning...

820
00:51:23.831 --> 00:51:27.293
Unreliable electricity...
Bloody flies everywhere.

821
00:51:35.509 --> 00:51:36.801
Hello, sir!

822
00:51:36.802 --> 00:51:39.430
That's Radha's music teacher.

823
00:51:39.847 --> 00:51:45.102
Radha's busy cooking for you
in the kitchen! What to do...

824
00:51:46.103 --> 00:51:47.438
Water?

825
00:51:47.730 --> 00:51:49.565
No! It's okay...

826
00:51:50.024 --> 00:51:51.357
Yeah... Actually...

827
00:51:51.358 --> 00:51:52.567
Yes or no?

828
00:51:52.568 --> 00:51:54.194
Yes... Yes...

829
00:51:54.570 --> 00:51:56.070
If it's not a problem...

830
00:51:56.071 --> 00:51:58.948
Now that you've reached our home...
Why should water be a problem?

831
00:51:58.949 --> 00:52:00.533
Radha! Water!

832
00:52:00.534 --> 00:52:02.077
Yes, coming!

833
00:52:09.376 --> 00:52:10.501
Hello, aunty.

834
00:52:10.502 --> 00:52:11.629
Hello.

835
00:52:12.588 --> 00:52:13.755
Thank you.

836
00:52:13.756 --> 00:52:16.924
Sorry forjust
showing up like this...

837
00:52:16.925 --> 00:52:18.176
This Ananya, I tell you...

838
00:52:18.177 --> 00:52:21.846
Never asks before inviting
people over! Please sit.

839
00:52:21.847 --> 00:52:22.848
Yes...

840
00:52:26.393 --> 00:52:27.977
I simply can't understand...

841
00:52:27.978 --> 00:52:31.940
why would your bank post
a North Indian in Chennai?

842
00:52:32.149 --> 00:52:34.151
Why?! Bloody, stupid bank.

843
00:52:35.444 --> 00:52:37.613
Uncle, is Ananya home?

844
00:52:39.990 --> 00:52:43.786
The look on his face! Like
I was hitting on his wife.

845
00:52:46.330 --> 00:52:48.374
What a strange house...

846
00:52:48.749 --> 00:52:51.335
then, suddenly
I began to hear sounds.

847
00:52:57.508 --> 00:52:59.885
Ah... Carnatic music!

848
00:53:01.470 --> 00:53:02.679
Beautiful, sir...

849
00:53:02.680 --> 00:53:04.431
Sorry, guys!

850
00:53:09.353 --> 00:53:10.979
- Hi, Ananya.
- Hi.

851
00:53:16.402 --> 00:53:17.528
Hi, dad!

852
00:53:20.072 --> 00:53:22.615
Oh, Amma's practicing!

853
00:53:22.616 --> 00:53:26.119
Sorry! Mom won the Tamil
Sangam Singing Championship...

854
00:53:26.120 --> 00:53:29.415
two years in a row
when Dad was posted in Kolkata!

855
00:53:29.623 --> 00:53:30.833
Oh...

856
00:53:31.083 --> 00:53:33.000
Sir, you must have
seen a lot of India!

857
00:53:33.001 --> 00:53:35.336
I was not on vacation!

858
00:53:35.337 --> 00:53:37.380
I was working,
every single day...

859
00:53:37.381 --> 00:53:39.132
Uh... You're right.

860
00:53:39.133 --> 00:53:43.761
I got to see a lot of India in
the last 15 years because of the job...

861
00:53:43.762 --> 00:53:46.223
But in the end,
I got stuck in Chennai.

862
00:53:46.390 --> 00:53:50.269
Stuck, sir?
Isn't Chennai your hometown?

863
00:53:53.188 --> 00:53:55.899
Ananya... Dinner.

864
00:53:59.737 --> 00:54:01.989
- Don't even think about it.
- No one's around!

865
00:54:02.197 --> 00:54:05.200
Mom and Dad are right there!

866
00:54:05.451 --> 00:54:08.120
By the way, you look
very nice in sari...

867
00:54:08.746 --> 00:54:11.456
Thanks.
You look okay, too.

868
00:54:11.457 --> 00:54:14.126
You're stuck at this beginner's level!

869
00:54:15.169 --> 00:54:17.128
How'll you ever make
any progress?

870
00:54:17.129 --> 00:54:19.506
You find someone else...
I can't do this.

871
00:54:24.178 --> 00:54:25.512
Come!

872
00:54:28.724 --> 00:54:29.933
Dad...

873
00:54:32.060 --> 00:54:34.521
He's come half way
across the country.

874
00:54:36.064 --> 00:54:37.649
Please be nice.

875
00:54:38.484 --> 00:54:39.860
For me.

876
00:54:41.737 --> 00:54:43.071
Okay?

877
00:54:43.739 --> 00:54:45.532
Thank you, Dad...

878
00:54:51.038 --> 00:54:51.913
No...

879
00:54:51.914 --> 00:54:54.333
That's the plate.

880
00:54:54.708 --> 00:54:59.708
I asked Pattama to find a
nice Brahmin boy for Ananya...

881
00:55:00.047 --> 00:55:01.964
But her own daughter
ran away with a foreigner!

882
00:55:01.965 --> 00:55:03.508
Listen to this.

883
00:55:03.509 --> 00:55:05.760
Same story in every house!

884
00:55:05.761 --> 00:55:08.013
Could you speak in Hindi?

885
00:55:08.472 --> 00:55:10.474
I don't understand Tamil...

886
00:55:11.141 --> 00:55:12.935
Learn Tamil, then.

887
00:55:14.853 --> 00:55:16.939
Anyway,
it doesn't concern you.

888
00:55:26.573 --> 00:55:28.324
- Krish!
- Yes?

889
00:55:28.325 --> 00:55:29.743
Let's elope?

890
00:55:30.035 --> 00:55:31.328
Come on!

891
00:55:33.372 --> 00:55:34.790
Okay, let's run away!

892
00:55:35.290 --> 00:55:36.416
<i>Can you?</i>

893
00:55:39.920 --> 00:55:41.504
I can't betray them...

894
00:55:41.505 --> 00:55:45.008
I want my parents to be
the happiest when I get married!

895
00:55:45.175 --> 00:55:48.345
I know it's hard but
we have to win them over.

896
00:55:49.304 --> 00:55:51.640
Do you really want to elope?

897
00:55:51.849 --> 00:55:53.183
No.

898
00:55:54.351 --> 00:55:57.771
I can't leave mom
alone with dad forever.

899
00:55:58.230 --> 00:56:01.900
Anyway... There's no
honour in running away.

900
00:56:04.611 --> 00:56:08.657
If we weren't in Mylapore...
I'd have kissed you.

901
00:56:11.869 --> 00:56:15.080
- Pattinapakkam?
- Rs. 200.

902
00:56:15.289 --> 00:56:16.707
Okay, go.

903
00:56:17.082 --> 00:56:19.251
Krish, I have an idea...

904
00:56:19.585 --> 00:56:21.377
by which you can come
to my house anytime.

905
00:56:21.378 --> 00:56:22.295
What?

906
00:56:22.296 --> 00:56:24.131
IIT tuitions for my brother.

907
00:56:24.464 --> 00:56:26.173
No, Ananya. No. No.

908
00:56:26.174 --> 00:56:28.635
Please! Not for free!
Tomorrow onwards 6 o' clock.

909
00:56:28.802 --> 00:56:31.178
What 6 o'clock?!
I work till <i>7</i> pm!

910
00:56:31.179 --> 00:56:33.515
- Evening is for us to hang out!
- Exactly.

911
00:56:36.435 --> 00:56:38.812
- No, Ananya!
- Bye!

912
00:56:42.524 --> 00:56:43.901
I love you!

913
00:56:44.234 --> 00:56:45.652
6 am tomorrow!

914
00:56:48.238 --> 00:56:51.909
"When the flame of love
re-ignites everyday"

915
00:56:53.785 --> 00:56:58.165
"lts smoke will rise..."

916
00:56:59.541 --> 00:57:02.127
"How can it be concealed?"

917
00:57:02.461 --> 00:57:04.755
My dear, you are
not perfecting anything!

918
00:57:05.172 --> 00:57:08.091
Find someone
else to teach you!

919
00:57:12.471 --> 00:57:16.433
"I can't tear my eyes away"

920
00:57:18.310 --> 00:57:23.190
"They seek only
your acceptance"

921
00:57:24.107 --> 00:57:29.404
"The kohl of
your eyes tinges my days"

922
00:57:29.821 --> 00:57:34.821
"While the smell of your
perfume haunts my nights"

923
00:57:34.952 --> 00:57:37.745
"Spellbound, this mind..."

924
00:57:37.746 --> 00:57:40.374
"Speaks only your name"

925
00:57:40.666 --> 00:57:43.501
"Spellbound, this mind..."

926
00:57:43.502 --> 00:57:46.129
"Speaks only your name"

927
00:57:47.255 --> 00:57:50.132
"Would that it could..."

928
00:57:50.133 --> 00:57:52.135
but it can't forget"

929
00:57:52.302 --> 00:57:55.096
"Spellbound, this mind..."

930
00:57:55.097 --> 00:57:57.557
"Speaks only your name"

931
00:57:58.016 --> 00:58:00.768
"Spellbound, this mind..."

932
00:58:00.769 --> 00:58:02.229
"Speaks only your name"

933
00:58:02.479 --> 00:58:03.647
Hi!

934
00:58:06.400 --> 00:58:08.235
I'm learning Tamil.

935
00:58:20.455 --> 00:58:23.290
"Here comes your Prince"

936
00:58:23.291 --> 00:58:26.211
"Shrouded in love"

937
00:58:26.837 --> 00:58:32.592
"Here he is, at your doorstep"

938
00:58:33.343 --> 00:58:39.099
"What do I care for riches?
They mean nothing to me"

939
00:58:39.307 --> 00:58:44.062
"With you, bleak is wonderful,
you're all I need."

940
00:58:44.354 --> 00:58:47.231
"Spellbound, this mind..."

941
00:58:47.232 --> 00:58:49.651
"Speaks only your name"

942
00:58:50.152 --> 00:58:52.821
"Spellbound, this mind..."

943
00:58:53.030 --> 00:58:55.699
"Speaks only your name"

944
00:58:56.366 --> 00:58:59.327
"Would that it could..."

945
00:58:59.536 --> 00:59:01.538
but it can't forget"

946
00:59:01.747 --> 00:59:04.374
"Spellbound, this mind..."

947
00:59:06.043 --> 00:59:07.001
Hello?

948
00:59:07.002 --> 00:59:08.128
Hello.

949
00:59:09.671 --> 00:59:11.048
How are you?

950
00:59:11.923 --> 00:59:13.383
Have you settled in?

951
00:59:13.592 --> 00:59:14.718
Where's mom?

952
00:59:15.135 --> 00:59:16.385
How's work going?

953
00:59:16.386 --> 00:59:17.971
Is Mom okay or
did something happen?

954
00:59:18.597 --> 00:59:20.182
Your mother is fine.

955
00:59:20.557 --> 00:59:21.892
She's at home.

956
00:59:22.601 --> 00:59:23.810
Then why did you call?

957
00:59:24.186 --> 00:59:25.937
What do you mean?

958
00:59:27.105 --> 00:59:28.773
To find out if you're okay.

959
00:59:28.774 --> 00:59:30.441
Even if I'm not, what is it to you?

960
00:59:30.442 --> 00:59:31.902
How shameless you are!

961
00:59:32.611 --> 00:59:34.487
I called to ask how you are...

962
00:59:34.488 --> 00:59:36.447
and you're being rude!

963
00:59:36.448 --> 00:59:38.408
What have I done
to deserve this, Krish?

964
00:59:38.867 --> 00:59:39.701
Kﬂsh?

965
00:59:40.869 --> 00:59:41.953
Hello!

966
00:59:55.300 --> 01:00:00.514
"Speaks only your name"

967
01:00:25.330 --> 01:00:26.497
Thank you, sir.

968
01:00:26.498 --> 01:00:28.250
For dropping me.

969
01:00:31.211 --> 01:00:32.795
So, how's work?

970
01:00:32.796 --> 01:00:34.172
<i>OKQY -</i>

971
01:00:36.258 --> 01:00:37.676
Nothing new?

972
01:00:37.926 --> 01:00:39.635
Same bank, same job.

973
01:00:39.636 --> 01:00:41.429
What could be new?

974
01:00:54.109 --> 01:00:56.026
You know how to
make these reports?

975
01:00:56.027 --> 01:00:58.195
Yes! Why?

976
01:00:58.196 --> 01:01:00.072
The new GM...

977
01:01:00.073 --> 01:01:02.741
Asked us to do Plug
Point presentations.

978
01:01:02.742 --> 01:01:04.285
Power Point, sir. Power Point!

979
01:01:04.286 --> 01:01:06.705
Fool! You idiot! Rascal!

980
01:01:06.955 --> 01:01:08.206
Sorry, sir.

981
01:01:10.000 --> 01:01:12.376
Not you,
the auto driver is an idiot!

982
01:01:12.377 --> 01:01:13.628
Scoundrel!

983
01:01:15.797 --> 01:01:17.674
Sir, if you want...

984
01:01:17.883 --> 01:01:22.637
I can help you with
the presentation...

985
01:01:23.805 --> 01:01:25.140
No, thank you.

986
01:01:26.600 --> 01:01:28.226
You can walk from here.

987
01:01:34.232 --> 01:01:35.399
Krish!

988
01:01:35.400 --> 01:01:36.483
Yes, sir?

989
01:01:36.484 --> 01:01:41.364
You're Ananya's friend... You
tutor my son... Thanks a lot.

990
01:01:42.991 --> 01:01:45.285
But you can't marry Ananya.

991
01:01:45.535 --> 01:01:46.286
But sir...

992
01:01:46.536 --> 01:01:48.914
No! We are simple people.

993
01:01:49.164 --> 01:01:50.873
Don't tarnish our
name in the community.

994
01:01:50.874 --> 01:01:52.500
- Sir, just-
- Please.

995
01:02:13.813 --> 01:02:17.983
We'll keep trying for a few weeks,
but if your parents don't agree...

996
01:02:17.984 --> 01:02:19.444
Then what, Krish?

997
01:02:22.072 --> 01:02:24.074
We'll try something else.

998
01:02:28.703 --> 01:02:33.083
Your company's promotional
event is this week, right?

999
01:02:33.500 --> 01:02:38.046
S.P. Balasubramaniam and
Shankar Mahadevan are performing.

1000
01:02:38.255 --> 01:02:40.548
They couldn't find
a third singer.

1001
01:02:41.174 --> 01:02:42.550
Can we come?

1002
01:02:42.717 --> 01:02:46.263
Of course!
I got passes for you all.

1003
01:02:46.471 --> 01:02:49.557
Great! I'm sure
mom will be happy...

1004
01:03:01.861 --> 01:03:03.779
Is he that fellow
everyone is talking about?

1005
01:03:03.780 --> 01:03:05.490
Shut up! I'll tell you later...

1006
01:03:07.284 --> 01:03:09.576
He's Manju's teacher.

1007
01:03:09.577 --> 01:03:10.995
Mahju!

1008
01:03:10.996 --> 01:03:12.622
Manju! Teacher!

1009
01:03:15.250 --> 01:03:16.667
Listen...

1010
01:03:16.668 --> 01:03:18.419
Something special
going on today?

1011
01:03:18.420 --> 01:03:20.421
That's Harish
from San Fransisco.

1012
01:03:20.422 --> 01:03:21.798
Harish who?

1013
01:03:21.965 --> 01:03:24.926
Ananya and his
stars have matched...

1014
01:03:25.176 --> 01:03:28.221
And special food
for special guest.

1015
01:03:28.763 --> 01:03:29.848
I'm very comfortable.

1016
01:03:42.944 --> 01:03:45.071
You start. I'll be back.

1017
01:03:51.536 --> 01:03:52.787
Congratulations!

1018
01:03:53.079 --> 01:03:55.457
Your groom is waiting
for you with his goggles.

1019
01:03:55.957 --> 01:03:58.043
- Krish, I'm sorry...
- That's great.

1020
01:03:58.209 --> 01:04:00.337
Do what you like
and then apologise.

1021
01:04:00.587 --> 01:04:04.049
Next time it'll be a wedding
card with an apology. Right?

1022
01:04:04.382 --> 01:04:06.967
Listen! This is only for Shobha Aunty!

1023
01:04:06.968 --> 01:04:09.804
Then why are you
wearing such a nice sari?

1024
01:04:13.183 --> 01:04:14.433
Thanks.

1025
01:04:14.434 --> 01:04:15.894
It's mom's.

1026
01:04:16.478 --> 01:04:18.187
Krish, I love you.

1027
01:04:18.188 --> 01:04:19.314
Breathe.

1028
01:04:21.775 --> 01:04:23.401
Let's run away.

1029
01:04:25.153 --> 01:04:27.655
Can't run in this sari.

1030
01:04:47.217 --> 01:04:48.801
She studied at
llM Ahmedabad...

1031
01:04:48.802 --> 01:04:50.637
and now she's working
in sales at Sunsilk.

1032
01:04:50.970 --> 01:04:53.223
He asked if I'm a virgin!

1033
01:04:53.431 --> 01:04:54.348
Virgin?!

1034
01:04:54.349 --> 01:04:57.977
I said only till I turned 18!
The way he ran...

1035
01:04:58.144 --> 01:05:00.814
Good! Otherwise I would
have to beat him up.

1036
01:05:01.064 --> 01:05:03.316
Your folks hate me...

1037
01:05:03.733 --> 01:05:05.401
and now you're leaving.

1038
01:05:05.402 --> 01:05:09.488
- What am I going to do?
- Help dad with his presentation!

1039
01:05:09.489 --> 01:05:11.157
You'll become friends.

1040
01:05:11.366 --> 01:05:12.825
I offered.

1041
01:05:12.826 --> 01:05:15.077
- He threw me out of the car.
- This time he won't.

1042
01:05:15.078 --> 01:05:18.372
I'm leaving and
Manju can't do it.

1043
01:05:18.373 --> 01:05:19.874
Who else will help him?

1044
01:05:24.754 --> 01:05:25.880
Sir!

1045
01:05:26.673 --> 01:05:31.845
Ananya was saying...
your presentation isn't ready...

1046
01:05:32.220 --> 01:05:35.390
I can help you, if you like...

1047
01:05:37.225 --> 01:05:39.769
Why are you being so helpful?

1048
01:05:40.061 --> 01:05:43.730
No... it's just... Work is
a little light these days...

1049
01:05:43.731 --> 01:05:45.900
So, I'm free
in the evenings...

1050
01:05:46.151 --> 01:05:49.446
And I don't know anyone here,
besides you'll.

1051
01:05:50.613 --> 01:05:53.366
I miss my family...

1052
01:06:05.962 --> 01:06:07.130
Krish.

1053
01:06:08.047 --> 01:06:10.966
If you're free tomorrow
evening... come home.

1054
01:06:10.967 --> 01:06:12.969
Thank you, Uncle! I mean...

1055
01:06:13.344 --> 01:06:14.471
Okay, sir.

1056
01:06:21.019 --> 01:06:22.479
I can't help you.

1057
01:06:22.729 --> 01:06:25.190
But, Master, if I practice...

1058
01:06:47.337 --> 01:06:48.796
Krish Malhotra.

1059
01:06:49.047 --> 01:06:51.466
I know it's meaningless
to talk to you...

1060
01:06:51.716 --> 01:06:55.845
But I thought I'd
try one last time.

1061
01:06:56.679 --> 01:06:59.264
One day when your
children disrespect you...

1062
01:06:59.265 --> 01:07:03.895
You'll understand what I went
through for all these years

1063
01:07:04.312 --> 01:07:06.813
I heard you were at my
house till pretty late last night...

1064
01:07:06.814 --> 01:07:08.815
Manju in the morning,
Daddy in the evening...

1065
01:07:08.816 --> 01:07:11.319
You should just hire me...
I'll buy the groceries also!

1066
01:07:13.154 --> 01:07:14.739
Come soon...

1067
01:07:15.698 --> 01:07:18.576
I heard your mother and
her useless sisters talking...

1068
01:07:19.160 --> 01:07:21.037
why you went to Chennai...

1069
01:07:21.287 --> 01:07:24.249
It's better if
we find you a girl...

1070
01:07:29.087 --> 01:07:33.174
Sir, you already have
two established singers...

1071
01:07:34.050 --> 01:07:37.470
I think you should
have one new singer.

1072
01:07:37.762 --> 01:07:39.847
Have you heard her sing?

1073
01:07:40.098 --> 01:07:41.641
Yes, sir.

1074
01:07:41.849 --> 01:07:43.393
She's very good!

1075
01:07:44.936 --> 01:07:46.062
No...

1076
01:07:46.271 --> 01:07:47.771
I can't do it.

1077
01:07:47.772 --> 01:07:49.898
I've never sung such songs!

1078
01:07:49.899 --> 01:07:52.818
Aunty, you'll be prepared
if you watch the songs on TV!

1079
01:07:52.819 --> 01:07:54.445
But... why me?

1080
01:07:55.154 --> 01:07:58.700
It's a YES Bank event...
They need a new singer.

1081
01:07:58.866 --> 01:08:01.578
And who's better than you?

1082
01:08:08.334 --> 01:08:11.253
Sometimes we make
impulsive decisions...

1083
01:08:11.254 --> 01:08:14.215
that fill our
whole lives with regret.

1084
01:08:14.507 --> 01:08:17.885
This girl may be the
biggest mistake of your life.

1085
01:08:18.219 --> 01:08:21.806
Unfortunately, your father.

1086
01:08:24.642 --> 01:08:25.685
Done, sir.

1087
01:08:25.893 --> 01:08:27.437
Oh... Good.

1088
01:08:28.688 --> 01:08:32.025
So, sir... all set for
your first presentation?

1089
01:08:32.525 --> 01:08:35.862
I had to prepare the report...

1090
01:08:36.696 --> 01:08:38.739
Verma will present it.

1091
01:08:38.740 --> 01:08:39.657
Why, sir?

1092
01:08:40.825 --> 01:08:44.036
Will you have another drink?
Radha's not home today.

1093
01:08:44.037 --> 01:08:46.496
No, sir, I should leave.
Won't be able to get rickshaws later.

1094
01:08:46.497 --> 01:08:47.914
Oh just relax. Relax.

1095
01:08:47.915 --> 01:08:49.334
Sleep here.

1096
01:08:49.500 --> 01:08:50.792
No, Sir. I'll leave...

1097
01:08:50.793 --> 01:08:53.254
Relax. One minute...

1098
01:08:56.174 --> 01:08:57.508
One minute.

1099
01:09:10.855 --> 01:09:14.651
Wear this to sleep in.
Very comfortable.

1100
01:09:16.319 --> 01:09:17.779
No, sir...

1101
01:09:20.281 --> 01:09:21.783
Thank you, sir.

1102
01:09:22.408 --> 01:09:25.453
What are you future plans?

1103
01:09:26.496 --> 01:09:29.165
Manager at YES Bank?

1104
01:09:34.962 --> 01:09:37.465
Actually, sir...
I want to be a writer.

1105
01:09:39.008 --> 01:09:40.718
Very good!

1106
01:09:42.762 --> 01:09:45.056
Working for yourself...

1107
01:09:45.431 --> 01:09:46.933
Very good!

1108
01:09:47.934 --> 01:09:49.727
Otherwise...

1109
01:09:51.646 --> 01:09:59.570
you'll be preparing all your
life for others' presentations...

1110
01:10:00.863 --> 01:10:02.907
Very good...

1111
01:10:07.328 --> 01:10:09.204
You've really got me in a fix!

1112
01:10:09.205 --> 01:10:12.374
Aunty, don't worry!
You're going to be a star.

1113
01:10:12.375 --> 01:10:15.877
- Just practice.
- No... I can't do it!

1114
01:10:15.878 --> 01:10:18.797
Aunty, you'll be very good!
I promise.

1115
01:10:18.798 --> 01:10:20.758
Just don't tell anyone.

1116
01:10:26.097 --> 01:10:27.389
- Hi, Krish.
- Hello, Uncle.

1117
01:10:27.390 --> 01:10:28.765
Hi.

1118
01:10:28.766 --> 01:10:30.183
Sorry, Krish.

1119
01:10:30.184 --> 01:10:31.435
Mom couldn't come.

1120
01:10:31.436 --> 01:10:33.895
She needed to urgently
go to her friend's house.

1121
01:10:33.896 --> 01:10:35.773
- Very sorry.
- It's okay.

1122
01:10:37.150 --> 01:10:38.901
Uncle, can I get you a drink?

1123
01:10:39.152 --> 01:10:40.445
I don't drink!

1124
01:10:48.202 --> 01:10:53.124
"The waves of music are rising"

1125
01:10:55.084 --> 01:11:00.631
"Desire is lingering in my mind"

1126
01:11:02.133 --> 01:11:07.305
"My heart yearns
to see you my dear!"

1127
01:11:09.766 --> 01:11:13.770
I was mesmerised
by your words"

1128
01:11:14.061 --> 01:11:18.064
"I hesitated to come close to you"

1129
01:11:18.065 --> 01:11:23.613
"I longed for you to
come near and embrace me!"

1130
01:11:25.698 --> 01:11:29.327
"You made a place in my heart"

1131
01:11:29.577 --> 01:11:33.206
"You stole my mind."

1132
01:11:33.498 --> 01:11:41.714
"You gave me boundless joy,
oh my life!"

1133
01:11:42.256 --> 01:11:47.762
"Oh my dear, what have you done?"

1134
01:11:48.304 --> 01:11:53.434
"Oh my love, what have you done?"

1135
01:11:54.811 --> 01:12:00.608
"Don't you know I've
been waiting for you?"

1136
01:12:00.817 --> 01:12:06.239
"Don't love me so..."

1137
01:12:06.489 --> 01:12:09.951
"Don't love me so..."

1138
01:12:12.161 --> 01:12:16.374
"Oh, how I love you"

1139
01:12:17.166 --> 01:12:21.503
I was mesmerised
by your words"

1140
01:12:21.504 --> 01:12:25.341
"I hesitated to come close to you"

1141
01:12:25.633 --> 01:12:31.097
"I longed for you to
come near and embrace me!"

1142
01:12:32.765 --> 01:12:40.982
"My heart yearns to
hear it time and again!"

1143
01:12:41.691 --> 01:12:44.735
"Say it's love..."

1144
01:12:45.528 --> 01:12:48.447
"Say it's love..."

1145
01:12:49.407 --> 01:12:52.994
"Yes, I love you!"

1146
01:12:53.286 --> 01:12:56.247
"Oh yes, I love you!"

1147
01:13:13.472 --> 01:13:15.181
And then Verma said...

1148
01:13:15.182 --> 01:13:19.061
"How did you do it?!" And I said,
"What? I know PowerPoint!"

1149
01:13:22.148 --> 01:13:25.026
- Aunty, any singing offers?
- No, no!

1150
01:13:25.318 --> 01:13:28.863
But I'm going to start
Contemporary singing classes now...

1151
01:13:37.121 --> 01:13:38.247
Uncle...

1152
01:13:38.706 --> 01:13:40.499
Aunty... Manju.

1153
01:13:42.043 --> 01:13:44.420
I have something to say.

1154
01:13:45.671 --> 01:13:48.341
I came to Chennai
6 months ago...

1155
01:13:49.425 --> 01:13:51.594
But I've been in love
with Ananya for 3 years.

1156
01:13:52.678 --> 01:13:54.764
And she loves me too...

1157
01:13:55.181 --> 01:13:56.515
I think.

1158
01:14:01.354 --> 01:14:05.191
We thought love is
enough to get married...

1159
01:14:05.608 --> 01:14:08.736
so we introduced you all
at the convocation.

1160
01:14:09.445 --> 01:14:11.614
But that's when we realized...

1161
01:14:12.406 --> 01:14:15.034
the journey from
love to marriage...

1162
01:14:16.369 --> 01:14:17.787
isn't easy.

1163
01:14:19.789 --> 01:14:21.832
We could have easily eloped...

1164
01:14:22.166 --> 01:14:27.046
But Ananya wanted
you all at her wedding...

1165
01:14:27.338 --> 01:14:28.673
And happy-

1166
01:14:29.006 --> 01:14:31.258
Happier than her!

1167
01:14:33.928 --> 01:14:35.638
I know...

1168
01:14:36.013 --> 01:14:41.227
I'm no Harish.

1169
01:14:43.729 --> 01:14:46.190
But please, don't hate me.

1170
01:14:49.694 --> 01:14:52.113
For our happiness...

1171
01:14:52.488 --> 01:14:54.573
accept me.

1172
01:14:58.411 --> 01:14:59.787
Please.

1173
01:15:08.879 --> 01:15:10.548
I, Krish Malhotra...

1174
01:15:13.509 --> 01:15:15.511
hereby ask
you all to marry me.

1175
01:15:23.728 --> 01:15:25.062
Nice.

1176
01:15:26.313 --> 01:15:29.025
Will you keep
my daughter happy?

1177
01:15:29.358 --> 01:15:30.943
Very happY-

1178
01:15:40.745 --> 01:15:43.705
Our cultures and backgrounds
are very different.

1179
01:15:43.706 --> 01:15:44.957
Mom!

1180
01:15:51.672 --> 01:15:56.426
Will your parents
accept my daughter?

1181
01:15:56.427 --> 01:15:57.928
I'll try my best.

1182
01:16:00.431 --> 01:16:01.807
I promise.

1183
01:16:25.998 --> 01:16:28.334
Krish is coming
at the perfect time!

1184
01:16:28.542 --> 01:16:30.960
All those pretty girls
at Minty's wedding...

1185
01:16:30.961 --> 01:16:32.629
he'll forget the Madrasan!

1186
01:16:32.630 --> 01:16:34.923
Basically, I just have to agree
with everything your mom says.

1187
01:16:34.924 --> 01:16:37.759
Yes! Plus it's
a good time to visit.

1188
01:16:37.760 --> 01:16:40.096
My cousin Minty
is getting married.

1189
01:16:42.765 --> 01:16:44.141
Minty!

1190
01:16:45.142 --> 01:16:48.770
You just need to win
over Mom and her family.

1191
01:16:48.771 --> 01:16:51.774
Dad won't agree...
but he's a lost cause.

1192
01:16:52.775 --> 01:16:54.192
Is the flight on time?

1193
01:16:54.193 --> 01:16:57.028
I'm glad this Chennai
nonsense is over.

1194
01:16:57.029 --> 01:17:00.616
Few days being fed at home...
and everything will be okay!

1195
01:17:03.202 --> 01:17:04.787
Focus, Ananya.

1196
01:17:04.995 --> 01:17:08.374
There's nothing scarier than
a Punjabi mother-in-law.

1197
01:17:09.291 --> 01:17:10.626
Can't wait.

1198
01:17:29.228 --> 01:17:31.814
Sorry...
for leaving... suddenly...

1199
01:17:34.150 --> 01:17:39.029
Have you gained some
weight in last four years?

1200
01:17:39.697 --> 01:17:40.739
Sorry!

1201
01:17:42.366 --> 01:17:44.034
I still don't
have any friends.

1202
01:17:45.244 --> 01:17:46.370
Anyway...

1203
01:17:49.081 --> 01:17:50.666
This is my new problem.

1204
01:17:52.293 --> 01:17:54.044
10 publishers have
rejected it already.

1205
01:17:55.087 --> 01:17:57.506
I'm meeting the
11th tomorrow...

1206
01:17:58.007 --> 01:17:59.133
to be rejected again.

1207
01:18:01.802 --> 01:18:05.389
Maybe it was a stupid
mistake to leave the bank...

1208
01:18:08.601 --> 01:18:12.521
But I'm no stranger
to stupid mistakes...

1209
01:18:15.149 --> 01:18:16.274
Oh! There he is!

1210
01:18:16.275 --> 01:18:18.861
The whole family is here.
Let go of my hand.

1211
01:18:19.361 --> 01:18:21.238
He brought this trouble here?!

1212
01:18:21.864 --> 01:18:24.533
Sister, she's
not pregnant, is she?

1213
01:18:25.117 --> 01:18:27.203
I'll kill that Madrasan,
if she is!

1214
01:18:31.040 --> 01:18:33.499
How are you? How was
the flight? Have you eaten?

1215
01:18:33.500 --> 01:18:34.876
Mom! Ananya.

1216
01:18:34.877 --> 01:18:37.546
Oh, I'm so happy to see you!

1217
01:18:38.839 --> 01:18:39.882
Hello, Aunty!

1218
01:18:40.966 --> 01:18:42.509
Ananya's here for a week!

1219
01:18:44.136 --> 01:18:46.055
- Oh, where will you stay?
- Company's guesthouse!

1220
01:18:46.388 --> 01:18:49.265
Oh, do drop by some time.

1221
01:18:49.266 --> 01:18:50.726
- Come on, take your stuff!
- Mom!

1222
01:18:51.268 --> 01:18:52.937
Ananya's accommodation
is from Monday.

1223
01:18:53.187 --> 01:18:55.022
She'll stay at
home for the weekend.

1224
01:18:56.023 --> 01:18:56.982
Whose home?

1225
01:18:58.776 --> 01:18:59.818
Ours?

1226
01:19:04.573 --> 01:19:07.409
Come! Come, get your stuff!

1227
01:19:09.828 --> 01:19:12.790
Isn't Rajji's
son-in-law handsome!

1228
01:19:13.082 --> 01:19:14.959
And such good values!

1229
01:19:15.251 --> 01:19:17.586
Always touches
his elders' feet...

1230
01:19:18.170 --> 01:19:19.421
What's his name?

1231
01:19:19.713 --> 01:19:20.923
Duke.

1232
01:19:21.257 --> 01:19:22.508
- What?!
- Duke!

1233
01:19:22.716 --> 01:19:24.426
What do you mean, Duke?

1234
01:19:24.635 --> 01:19:27.178
He's from London!
So his pet name is Duke.

1235
01:19:27.179 --> 01:19:29.139
How much are they
spending on the wedding?

1236
01:19:29.348 --> 01:19:35.437
25 lakhs! 4 lakhs just on imported
liquor! Plus a car for the boy.

1237
01:19:36.313 --> 01:19:38.649
Don't tell anyone.
It's a surprise.

1238
01:19:39.108 --> 01:19:41.819
Anyway, a boy like
that is a dime to a dozen!

1239
01:19:42.111 --> 01:19:43.320
That's true.

1240
01:19:45.239 --> 01:19:48.701
When I asked if Duke
is worth so much...

1241
01:19:49.118 --> 01:19:51.870
how much will Krish
get at his wedding?!

1242
01:19:52.329 --> 01:19:53.622
<i>You know what Ram said...</i>

1243
01:19:53.872 --> 01:19:59.420
At least a wedding of Rs. 40 lakhs
and gifts worth Rs. 10 lakhs!

1244
01:19:59.837 --> 01:20:01.046
Well, good!

1245
01:20:01.338 --> 01:20:03.507
At least we know
my market value now.

1246
01:20:10.848 --> 01:20:11.974
Aunty...

1247
01:20:12.558 --> 01:20:15.561
You could've sent the driver alone.
You didn't have to trouble yourself.

1248
01:20:17.187 --> 01:20:18.314
It's no problem, son.

1249
01:20:19.398 --> 01:20:20.858
It's not like you came alone,
either.

1250
01:20:33.078 --> 01:20:34.663
Didn't you tell your mom
that I was coming?

1251
01:20:36.081 --> 01:20:37.374
I wanted to surprise her!

1252
01:20:38.125 --> 01:20:40.626
There's a big difference
between surprise and shock!

1253
01:20:40.627 --> 01:20:41.670
True.

1254
01:20:42.629 --> 01:20:44.006
Anyway, she's out.

1255
01:20:44.340 --> 01:20:45.758
- Can we...
- No chance!

1256
01:20:46.050 --> 01:20:47.550
Why are you being
aggressive, dude?

1257
01:20:47.551 --> 01:20:49.720
Just listen to me!
Ananya, relax.

1258
01:20:49.970 --> 01:20:52.348
Mom just talks...
but she's good at heart.

1259
01:20:53.474 --> 01:20:55.017
Well, Hitler was probably
'good at heart' too.

1260
01:20:56.018 --> 01:20:57.436
You want to take
the next flight back?

1261
01:20:58.228 --> 01:20:59.396
Okay. Sorry.

1262
01:20:59.855 --> 01:21:01.065
What do I do?!

1263
01:21:01.940 --> 01:21:02.941
Cook!

1264
01:21:03.400 --> 01:21:05.069
You Punjabis
are always hungry.

1265
01:21:05.361 --> 01:21:07.070
No! I mean...

1266
01:21:07.071 --> 01:21:09.615
Just help mom with
dinner tonight!

1267
01:21:10.240 --> 01:21:11.450
No, better idea!

1268
01:21:12.451 --> 01:21:17.080
Tell her you'll make dinner tonight!
She'll be so impressed!

1269
01:21:17.081 --> 01:21:18.164
Are you mad?

1270
01:21:18.165 --> 01:21:19.458
I don't know how to cook!

1271
01:21:19.792 --> 01:21:20.793
What?!

1272
01:21:21.126 --> 01:21:22.086
What?

1273
01:21:22.961 --> 01:21:24.296
Do you know how to cook?

1274
01:21:25.047 --> 01:21:26.340
But I'm a guy...

1275
01:21:27.299 --> 01:21:29.259
And women belong
in the kitchen, right?

1276
01:21:29.968 --> 01:21:31.387
- Right.
- Krish!

1277
01:21:33.263 --> 01:21:34.848
Sorry. I can't do it.

1278
01:21:37.851 --> 01:21:40.104
Remember what you said?
You'll do your best.

1279
01:21:40.479 --> 01:21:41.814
Yes, I remember, but-

1280
01:21:48.862 --> 01:21:50.823
Aunty... can I help?

1281
01:21:51.365 --> 01:21:52.240
No.

1282
01:21:52.241 --> 01:21:54.410
Ananya's a really
good cook, Mom!

1283
01:21:55.536 --> 01:21:56.537
Really?

1284
01:22:00.749 --> 01:22:01.916
Here.

1285
01:22:01.917 --> 01:22:04.878
I was thinking we should
have chicken and parathas.

1286
01:22:05.170 --> 01:22:09.550
Maybe some dal...
and raita! Oh, I almost forgot...

1287
01:22:09.758 --> 01:22:11.844
- Make some rice, too.
- Mom... mom!

1288
01:22:12.386 --> 01:22:16.515
If you both cook together you'll
get done so much quicker!

1289
01:22:17.349 --> 01:22:20.018
What's the hurry, son?
Take your time.

1290
01:22:20.644 --> 01:22:24.565
Anyway, I'm tired
of eating my own cooking.

1291
01:22:25.023 --> 01:22:27.943
Okay, look.
The flour is under the stove.

1292
01:22:28.152 --> 01:22:30.988
The lentils and spice
powders are in that cabinet.

1293
01:22:31.363 --> 01:22:32.990
- Anything else?
- Um...

1294
01:22:33.365 --> 01:22:34.366
Dessert?

1295
01:22:36.034 --> 01:22:38.078
No... not today.

1296
01:22:39.246 --> 01:22:41.248
I'm going to my room...

1297
01:22:41.498 --> 01:22:44.168
Call me when
the food is ready.

1298
01:22:44.460 --> 01:22:45.502
<i>OKQY -</i>

1299
01:22:55.512 --> 01:22:57.014
- Can I help?
- No.

1300
01:23:02.019 --> 01:23:03.144
Did you get hurt?

1301
01:23:03.145 --> 01:23:07.274
I said I would try my best. So what
if I have to shed some blood for it?

1302
01:23:08.942 --> 01:23:10.568
- Young or old...

1303
01:23:10.569 --> 01:23:12.905
All women are
born melodramatic.

1304
01:23:19.995 --> 01:23:20.996
What is that?!

1305
01:23:21.205 --> 01:23:22.414
I don't know.

1306
01:23:22.706 --> 01:23:25.042
- Don't know? It's burnt!
- What's happening here?

1307
01:23:26.710 --> 01:23:28.754
Is this any way to cook?!

1308
01:23:29.838 --> 01:23:31.673
- And what are you doing here?
- Nothing!

1309
01:23:32.174 --> 01:23:33.425
I can see that.

1310
01:23:34.259 --> 01:23:36.887
Wait till you're married,
she'll make you her puppet!

1311
01:23:37.221 --> 01:23:39.055
She doesn't even know
how to make chapatis!

1312
01:23:39.056 --> 01:23:40.682
I don't know anything, Aunty!

1313
01:23:41.975 --> 01:23:44.186
Except how to trap
innocent young boys.

1314
01:23:45.270 --> 01:23:46.438
Mom!

1315
01:23:47.940 --> 01:23:48.899
Ananya...

1316
01:23:49.858 --> 01:23:50.901
Anan...

1317
01:23:51.944 --> 01:23:54.571
Mom, she's trying!
Just give her a chance!

1318
01:23:54.821 --> 01:23:57.407
Why should I?
What is she to me?

1319
01:23:57.783 --> 01:23:59.201
I love her.

1320
01:23:59.993 --> 01:24:01.787
She's really got you bad.

1321
01:24:02.788 --> 01:24:04.748
First, you wasted
my mango juice on her...

1322
01:24:05.040 --> 01:24:06.499
now you're
fighting with me!

1323
01:24:06.500 --> 01:24:07.708
What are you saying, Mom?!
She'll hear you!

1324
01:24:07.709 --> 01:24:09.920
Then let her hear!
I'm not afraid of anyone!

1325
01:24:26.603 --> 01:24:28.021
I want to go
to the guesthouse.

1326
01:24:29.189 --> 01:24:31.483
Ananya, if you act like this,
we don't stand a chance.

1327
01:24:37.322 --> 01:24:38.949
She hates me, Krish.

1328
01:24:40.450 --> 01:24:41.618
Relax.

1329
01:24:42.160 --> 01:24:44.204
You know she doesn't hate you.

1330
01:24:44.955 --> 01:24:47.666
Just give it sometime.

1331
01:24:47.958 --> 01:24:49.293
Everything will be okay.

1332
01:25:01.805 --> 01:25:03.390
Mom...
When is Minty's wedding?

1333
01:25:04.224 --> 01:25:05.559
Next Friday to Sunday.

1334
01:25:06.810 --> 01:25:08.353
- You're coming, right?
- Yes.

1335
01:25:08.729 --> 01:25:10.439
Ananya will come too.

1336
01:25:11.690 --> 01:25:14.860
What am I supposed
to say to who she is?

1337
01:25:15.444 --> 01:25:16.778
My fiancée.

1338
01:25:18.864 --> 01:25:20.949
Mom, please! Let me speak.

1339
01:25:23.619 --> 01:25:28.957
What's the point? If you've
made up your mind, go get married.

1340
01:25:29.249 --> 01:25:31.667
Go right now! I'm sure some
temple will still be open.

1341
01:25:31.668 --> 01:25:33.045
- Mom, just -
- Aunty, please?

1342
01:25:33.670 --> 01:25:35.631
We want you to happily agree.

1343
01:25:35.922 --> 01:25:37.174
We don't want to force you.

1344
01:25:38.050 --> 01:25:39.384
But you are forcing me!

1345
01:25:40.927 --> 01:25:42.846
I worked hard to raise him.

1346
01:25:43.764 --> 01:25:45.140
I have some expectations, too.

1347
01:25:45.390 --> 01:25:47.893
I want my in-laws
to respect me.

1348
01:25:48.352 --> 01:25:52.521
My family and I will find
a very nice girl for Krish.

1349
01:25:52.522 --> 01:25:54.732
Why do you think
they won't like her?!

1350
01:25:54.733 --> 01:25:58.236
- Because she's not Punjabi?
- Just let Ananya meet them once!

1351
01:25:58.945 --> 01:26:00.112
Look, Krish.

1352
01:26:00.113 --> 01:26:03.408
I've been taunted my whole
life because of your father.

1353
01:26:03.617 --> 01:26:05.701
I can't take any
more because of you.

1354
01:26:05.702 --> 01:26:08.622
Nothing like that will happen.
I promise.

1355
01:26:17.214 --> 01:26:18.632
Aunty, I'm sorry...

1356
01:26:19.716 --> 01:26:22.094
forjust showing
up like this.

1357
01:26:22.761 --> 01:26:24.012
It's not your fault.

1358
01:26:25.013 --> 01:26:28.225
Krish is the one who
never tells me anything.

1359
01:26:29.685 --> 01:26:30.644
Yes, Aunty.

1360
01:26:31.103 --> 01:26:33.271
His communication
skills are a little weak...

1361
01:26:33.897 --> 01:26:36.817
Not a little...
They're very weak.

1362
01:26:41.196 --> 01:26:42.698
Where's Uncle?

1363
01:26:44.449 --> 01:26:45.701
I don't know.

1364
01:26:46.284 --> 01:26:47.994
I'll know if he
bothers to return.

1365
01:27:12.644 --> 01:27:13.812
Good morning, Uncle.

1366
01:27:22.028 --> 01:27:23.155
I'm Ananya.

1367
01:27:24.030 --> 01:27:25.198
Krish's friend.

1368
01:27:28.285 --> 01:27:30.661
Hurry up or we'll
get stuck in traffic.

1369
01:27:30.662 --> 01:27:31.830
Where are you going?

1370
01:27:33.498 --> 01:27:34.750
I'll get the bag.

1371
01:27:39.296 --> 01:27:42.339
Tell your shameless son
to show some respect or I'll...

1372
01:27:42.340 --> 01:27:43.842
- What happened?
- What do you mean what happened?!

1373
01:27:44.092 --> 01:27:45.469
Who's this girl?!

1374
01:27:45.927 --> 01:27:47.970
- She's his friend.
- This is normal for this house.

1375
01:27:47.971 --> 01:27:49.889
- His friend?!
- Sorry...

1376
01:27:49.890 --> 01:27:51.183
- What is she doing
in our house?!

1377
01:27:51.558 --> 01:27:54.894
It's not your fault. Let's go.

1378
01:27:54.895 --> 01:27:56.979
- He's going to drop
her to guesthouse now.

1379
01:27:56.980 --> 01:27:59.690
I didn't know she was coming. I was
going to tell you in the morning...

1380
01:27:59.691 --> 01:28:02.611
Morning?!
When will your morning begin?

1381
01:28:03.069 --> 01:28:05.989
Please, Vikram...
It's too early to fight...

1382
01:28:09.868 --> 01:28:11.328
Why were we doing this?

1383
01:28:12.329 --> 01:28:13.872
Pretending to
be a normal family?

1384
01:28:18.752 --> 01:28:20.128
I missed Chennai...

1385
01:28:23.799 --> 01:28:25.342
Why had I brought Ananya here?

1386
01:28:28.428 --> 01:28:29.846
I was misleading
the poor girl.

1387
01:28:35.185 --> 01:28:36.937
Why didn't she just leave me?

1388
01:29:01.920 --> 01:29:02.963
Dad...

1389
01:29:04.130 --> 01:29:05.674
I wanted to talk to you...

1390
01:29:13.431 --> 01:29:14.599
There's this girl...

1391
01:29:15.183 --> 01:29:16.268
Rashmi.

1392
01:29:19.646 --> 01:29:20.981
My professor's daughter...

1393
01:29:22.816 --> 01:29:24.359
Is this what
you do in college?

1394
01:29:24.818 --> 01:29:26.653
Dad, please...
Hear me out.

1395
01:29:28.280 --> 01:29:29.322
533/-

1396
01:29:31.783 --> 01:29:34.202
They're getting her
married to someone else.

1397
01:29:35.370 --> 01:29:38.623
Oh, so they're
against it, too.

1398
01:29:38.874 --> 01:29:39.916
Good.

1399
01:29:40.834 --> 01:29:42.919
They have a problem with me...

1400
01:29:44.045 --> 01:29:45.171
What problem?

1401
01:29:47.257 --> 01:29:49.801
Bunking... Discipline... Etc.

1402
01:29:55.307 --> 01:29:56.766
Does your mother
know about this?

1403
01:29:59.936 --> 01:30:00.979
Kavita.

1404
01:30:02.439 --> 01:30:03.648
Kavita!

1405
01:30:06.902 --> 01:30:08.194
Did you know about this?

1406
01:30:09.696 --> 01:30:12.657
- Yes, I was going to tell you...
- Tell me when?

1407
01:30:12.991 --> 01:30:14.283
- Dad-
- You be quiet.

1408
01:30:14.284 --> 01:30:15.910
- When were you going to tell me?
- Dad it's not Mom's fault,

1409
01:30:15.911 --> 01:30:17.077
please just talk to
the professor once...

1410
01:30:17.078 --> 01:30:18.705
Why should I talk
to the professor?

1411
01:30:19.331 --> 01:30:21.291
I'm not going to
support this nonsense.

1412
01:30:22.667 --> 01:30:23.792
I love her.

1413
01:30:23.793 --> 01:30:24.878
Forget about it.

1414
01:30:25.837 --> 01:30:27.213
Concentrate on your MBA.

1415
01:30:28.173 --> 01:30:29.549
Girls will come and go.

1416
01:30:34.137 --> 01:30:35.931
These are just distractions.

1417
01:30:36.765 --> 01:30:38.934
But you didn't have
any distractions, Dad.

1418
01:30:39.809 --> 01:30:41.310
Let it go, Krish.

1419
01:30:41.311 --> 01:30:42.520
What did you say?

1420
01:30:47.817 --> 01:30:49.402
Yet you were thrown
out of the army.

1421
01:30:50.779 --> 01:30:51.821
Why?

1422
01:30:54.574 --> 01:30:56.159
What are you doing, Vikram?

1423
01:30:56.952 --> 01:30:58.244
This is what he deserves.

1424
01:30:59.454 --> 01:31:01.915
He's shameless.
Won't learn any other way.

1425
01:31:03.541 --> 01:31:04.918
Good for nothing.

1426
01:31:22.811 --> 01:31:24.896
You know how he
is when he drinks.

1427
01:31:28.483 --> 01:31:29.985
Are you okay?

1428
01:31:32.195 --> 01:31:33.446
Kavita!

1429
01:31:37.659 --> 01:31:39.243
You're the one who's spoiled him!

1430
01:31:39.244 --> 01:31:41.161
- Just listen!
- Listen to what?!

1431
01:31:41.162 --> 01:31:43.539
Sometimes he wants to be a writer,
sometimes he's in love!

1432
01:31:43.540 --> 01:31:45.624
He's a kid!
He needs our support.

1433
01:31:45.625 --> 01:31:47.751
I will not support this rubbish!

1434
01:31:47.752 --> 01:31:49.628
He's wasting his time
and my money!

1435
01:31:49.629 --> 01:31:51.548
You could have
heard him out!

1436
01:31:52.132 --> 01:31:54.134
Like you can do
anything but drink!

1437
01:31:54.426 --> 01:31:56.719
Then why don't you just leave!

1438
01:31:56.720 --> 01:31:59.597
Marrying you was the
biggest mistake of my life.

1439
01:32:00.640 --> 01:32:01.933
It was your mistake...

1440
01:32:02.267 --> 01:32:04.477
and it's my
life that's ruined.

1441
01:32:08.356 --> 01:32:09.607
Get out of here.

1442
01:32:10.442 --> 01:32:11.484
Krish, please go.

1443
01:32:12.444 --> 01:32:14.195
I said get out of here!

1444
01:32:15.405 --> 01:32:17.115
Can't you hear what-

1445
01:34:05.014 --> 01:34:07.350
You're so fair!
How can you be a Madrasan?

1446
01:34:07.767 --> 01:34:08.851
Tamilian.

1447
01:34:08.852 --> 01:34:12.313
Same thing! Oh, Kavita!
Your daughter-in-law?

1448
01:34:13.189 --> 01:34:16.358
I must say she's quite fair
by South Indian standards!

1449
01:34:16.359 --> 01:34:19.237
Rajji, come meet
our Krish's lover!

1450
01:34:19.571 --> 01:34:20.529
Anyay!
(mega!)

1451
01:34:20.530 --> 01:34:23.408
Anyay? Like... illegal?!

1452
01:34:37.213 --> 01:34:40.175
"This Punjabi
boy from Jalandhar"

1453
01:34:40.717 --> 01:34:43.887
"Maidens falling
for every glance"

1454
01:34:44.304 --> 01:34:47.557
"Chilling in the fields"

1455
01:34:47.891 --> 01:34:51.269
"Living life King size"

1456
01:34:51.603 --> 01:34:54.981
"it's my way or the highway"

1457
01:34:55.231 --> 01:34:58.359
"Who does it make
a difference to?"

1458
01:34:58.568 --> 01:35:01.863
"What, why? Who is who? Only
to whiskey friends are true!"

1459
01:35:02.155 --> 01:35:05.408
"And some chicken with
it only makes things better!"

1460
01:35:05.742 --> 01:35:07.284
"Where the pretty girls are"

1461
01:35:07.285 --> 01:35:08.994
"That's where you'll
find the Jatt boys"

1462
01:35:08.995 --> 01:35:12.624
"Even better if the
girls are up for it too"

1463
01:35:41.069 --> 01:35:44.280
"Punjabi girl,
not so easily charmed"

1464
01:35:44.781 --> 01:35:48.034
"She'll make you dance
on her every tune!"

1465
01:35:48.451 --> 01:35:51.371
"Boys fall by the dozen"

1466
01:35:51.871 --> 01:35:55.166
"for every sway
of their hips!"

1467
01:35:55.667 --> 01:35:57.043
"Dinky on the left"

1468
01:35:57.460 --> 01:35:58.962
"Pinky on the right"

1469
01:35:59.337 --> 01:36:02.673
"Like a fashion parade
of pretty girls!"

