"Where the pretty girls are"

1473
01:36:11.266 --> 01:36:13.058
"That's where you'll
find the Jatt boys"

1474
01:36:13.059 --> 01:36:16.771
"Even better if the
girls are up for it too"

1475
01:36:45.591 --> 01:36:52.098
"Don't boast your
broken Punjabi to me"

1476
01:36:52.432 --> 01:36:59.105
"Tell me how much your
promises really mean?"

1477
01:36:59.605 --> 01:37:05.903
"Tell me how much your
promises really mean?"

1478
01:37:06.487 --> 01:37:09.699
"The word of a Jatt
boy is legally binding"

1479
01:37:10.074 --> 01:37:13.827
"He'll sign his
life over to you!"

1480
01:37:13.828 --> 01:37:16.789
"Chilling in the fields"

1481
01:37:17.248 --> 01:37:20.835
"Living life King size"

1482
01:37:21.210 --> 01:37:24.380
"it's my way or the highway"

1483
01:37:24.714 --> 01:37:27.550
"Who does it make
a difference to?"

1484
